 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; BioTracker™ 2 PPG Bio-tracking Optical Sensor\r\n</p><ul><li>Sport\r\n</li></ul><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Geomagnetic Sensor, Gyroscope Sensor, Capacitive Sensor, Air&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Pressure Sensor,\r\n</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Accelerometer Sensor, Ambient Light Sensor</p><p><b>CONNECTION</b></p><ul><li>Bluetooth : Bluetooth 5.0 BLE</li></ul><p><b>OTHERS</b></p><ul><li>&nbsp;Memory:&nbsp; 16MB + 256MB</li></ul><ul><li>Positioning: GPS + GLONASS</li></ul><ul><li>Microphone: Yes</li></ul><ul><li>Motor:&nbsp; Linear Motor</li></ul><p><b>BANDS</b></p><ul><li>Materials : Leather</li><li>Width : 22 mm</li><li>Buckle: Classic Pin Buckle</li></ul>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(155,155,'Moshi USB-C to Gigabit Ethernet Adapter','PC','<p><b>Description\r\n</b></p><p>Moshi\'s USB-C to Gigabit Ethernet Adapter enables any laptop equipped with a USB-C port such as Apple\'s MacBook to establish a fast and reliable wired internet connection. Encased in aluminum to minimize electromagnetic interference, the adapter conforms to the latest USB-C specifications and is also compatible with Thunderbolt 3. It also features integrated link/activity LEDs to show the status of your wired connection. Best of all, it includes a USB pass-through port so you can charge your phone or connect an additional USB device to your computer.\r\n</p><p><b>Features\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Connects your USB-C laptop via Gigabit Ethernet for data transfer speeds up to 1000 Mbps.\r\n</li><li>Anodized aluminum casing minimizes electromagnetic interference.\r\n</li><li>Includes a pass-through USB port for connecting extra devices (USB 3.1 Gen 1).\r\n</li><li>100% Plug-n-Play and Thunderbolt 3 compatible.\r\n</li><li>Integrated Link/Activity LED indicators.\r\n</li></ul><p><b>Compatibility\r\n</b></p><ul><li>MacBook Pro (Retina, 15-inch, Late 2016)\r\n</li><li>MacBook Pro (Retina, 13-inch, Late 2016)\r\n</li><li>MacBook (Retina, 12-inch)</li></ul>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(156,156,'Moshi USB 3.0 to Gigabit Ethernet Adapter','PC','<p>Enjoy maximum wired connectivity with Moshi\'s USB to Gigabit Ethernet Adapter. Using a SuperSpeed USB 3.0 port on your MacBook means your Thunderbolt port remains open for convenient docking to an external display. Encased in aluminum to minimize electromagnetic interference, the adapter is also 100% plug-n-play and requires no installation discs or external power. Best of all, it includes a USB pass-through port so your MacBook retains full USB 3.0 connectivity.\r\n</p><p>Connects your MacBook via Gigabit Ethernet for data transfer speeds up to 1000 Mbps.\r\n</p><p>Anodized aluminum casing to protect from electromagnetic interference.\r\n</p><p>Includes a pass-through USB 3.0 port for maximum USB connectivity.\r\n</p><p>Easy to setup and requires no installation discs or external power adapters.\r\n</p><p>Dimensions 8.81\" x 1.19\" x 0.6\" (22.39 x 3.02 x 1.52 cm)\r\n</p><p>Available In\r\n</p><p>Silver\r\n</p><p>Compatibility\r\n</p><p>Compatible with any laptop or desktop with a USB port. (USB 3.0 is recommended for fastest data transfer speeds.)\r\n</p><p>OS X 10.6 and Later\r\n</p><p>Windows XP / Windows Vista / Windows 7 / Windows 8 / Windows 8.1 / Windows 10 and Later</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(157,157,'Brydge 9.7 Bluetooth Keyboard','pc','<p>Aluminum Construction\r\n</p><p>Bluetooth 3.0 Wireless Technology\r\n</p><p>Tilts up to 180°\r\n</p><p>3-Level Backlit Keys</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(158,158,'Moshi HDMI to VGA Adapter','PC','<p>Description Moshi\'s ultra-compact HDMI to VGA Adapter with Audio lets you connect your HDMI-equpped MacBook or Apple TV to a VGA projector, TV, or monitor. The adapter features a 3.5 mm headphone jack for clear audio output in presentations and videos. Inside the anodized aluminum housing is a full-featured converter that supports all standard output resolutions up to 1080p at 60Hz. Designed for portability, the adapter does not require external power, making it the ideal accessory for both professional and personal use. Features Ultra-compact form factor for enhanced portability. Premium digital HDMI to analog VGA converter supports full HD 1080p resolution. Built-in 3.5 mm headphone jack supports 2-channel audio output. 100% plug-n-play, no software driver or external power adapter required. Aluminum casing minimizes electromagnetic interference. Dimensions 2.0\" x 0.9\" x 0.5\" (5.1 x 2.3 x 1.3 cm) Available In Silver Compatibility All devices that support HDMI Product Weight 0.49 oz (14 g)</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(159,159,'Satechi Aluminum Wireless Keypad','PC','<p><ul><li>Wireless keypad with 22 keys – includes “undo”, “cut”, “copy”, “paste”\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Bluetooth 3.0 - Compatible with Bluetooth-Capable Macs and PCs\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Ergonomic tilt and anti-slip pads on back provides optimum comfort\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Expand your existing keyboard – use the wireless keypad to assist in accounting tasks, excel spreadsheets, and more\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Powers with two AAA batteries and boasts up to 6 Months of battery life (based on 1 hour of usage/day)</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(160,160,'Brydge 9.7 Bluetooth Keyboard','pc','<p><ul><li>Aluminum Construction\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Bluetooth 3.0 Wireless Technology\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Tilts up to 180°\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>3-Level Backlit Keys</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(161,161,'Satechi Slim Rechargeable Aluminum Bluetooth Keypad','PC','<p><ul><li>Wireless keypad: Bluetooth 3.0 - Compatible with Bluetooth-Capable Macs and PCs\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Ergonomic tilt and anti-slip pads: pads on back provide optimum comfort and securely keep the keypad in place\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Expand your existing keyboard: use the wireless keypad to assist in accounting tasks, excel spreadsheets, and more\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Rechargeable battery: Built-in lithium battery typically lasts up to two weeks and when not in use after 1 hour, will go into sleep mode\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Premium aluminum construction sleek aluminum design comes in gold, silver, or space gray, making the keypad the perfect complement to your Apple products</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(162,162,'Brydge 9.7 Bluetooth Keyboard','pc','<p><ul><li>Aluminum Construction\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Bluetooth 3.0 Wireless Technology\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Tilts up to 180°\r\n</li></ul></p><ul><li>3-Level Backlit Keys\r\n</li></ul><p><br></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(163,163,'JCPAL ComforPad Mouse Pad','PC','<p>The JCPAL ComforPad has a streamlined design while the mouse-moving area\'s large enough for comfortable and efficient operation. The ComforPad complies with ergonomic design plus it always gives you the most gentle and and comfortable support to reduce write fatigue. The surface is made with environmentally-friendly material and can accurately capture mouse movement. The underside has a non-slip treatment and keeps steady while using your mouse. Features Anti-bacterial finish Anti-fatigue Ergonomic design Anti-scratch Reassuring design</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(164,164,'Moshi Venturo Titanium Gray','PC','<p>Venturo is a slim laptop backpack with a crossbody design that lets you sling your bag from back to front for quick access to all of your gear. A roomy interior features independent cushioned compartments to secure a laptop (up to 15\") as well as an iPad/tablet. Additional interior pockets organize your cables, accessories, and other necessities. Venturo is built with advanced, lightweight materials that are both wear- and weather-resistant for extra durability. Padded Airmesh fabric lines the quick-release shoulder strap and back support for excellent ventilation, as well as an ergonomic fit. A zippered rear compartment adds an element of security by keeping important documents such as a passport or ID close to your body. The ultimate in convenience and style, Venturo is an indispensable companion for your daily commute or long-haul trips. Features Crossbody design with quick-release strap for fast access. Cushioned laptop (up to 15\") and iPad compartment. Lightweight and durable fabric with weather-resistant surface treatment. Padded Airmesh strap and back support. Exterior pocket zips up to stow a water bottle or umbrella. Dimensions 20\" x 14.57\" x 4.1\" (51 x 37 x 10.5 cm) Compatibility Up to 15\" Laptops Cleaning Instructions: Moshi\'s Venturo collection is carefully crafted with a combination of high-resilience polyester and PU leather. The outer surface of Venturo has been treated to be splash-repellent and can be cleaned with commercial leather cleaners. The inner lining of Venturo can be treated with a damp cloth in conjunction with suede cleaner. Never use bleach or any harsh solvents on Venturo. Let Venturo dry naturally after cleaning. Do not machine wash or dry clean Venturo.</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(165,165,'Moshi Venturo Navy Blue','PC','<p>Venturo is a slim laptop backpack with a crossbody design that lets you sling your bag from back to front for quick access to all of your gear. A roomy interior features independent cushioned compartments to secure a laptop (up to 15\") as well as an iPad/tablet. Additional interior pockets organize your cables, accessories, and other necessities. Venturo is built with advanced, lightweight materials that are both wear- and weather-resistant for extra durability. Padded Airmesh fabric lines the quick-release shoulder strap and back support for excellent ventilation, as well as an ergonomic fit. A zippered rear compartme