tyiOS 8 above, macOS, Windows XP/7/8/10\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Supported ModelsiPhone 7 Plus, iPhone 7, iPhone SE, iPhone 6s Plus, iPhone 6s, iPhone 6 Plus, iPhone 6, iPhone 5s, iPhone 5c, iPhone 5, iPad Pro, iPad mini4, iPad Air 2, iPad mini3, iPad Air, iPad mini 2, iPad mini, iPad (4th gen.), iPod touch (6th gen.), iPod touch (5th gen.)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>microSD Card compatibilitymicroSD/SDHC/SDXC\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>microSD speedclass 6/8/10/U1/U3\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>CertificationMFi (Made for iPhone/ iPad/ iPod); CE; FCC; BSMI; C-tick; KC\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Memory solutionmicroSD memory card\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>FormatFAT32, exFAT\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>iOS App RequirmentFree App installation(App name: iKlips App)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Place of OriginTaiwan \r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Product DimensionsL 220.6 x W 20.2 x H 10 mm\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Product Weight23.25g</li></ul></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(175,175,'Adam Elements OMNIA Xe USB-C PD / QC 3.0 20W Ultra Compact Wall Charger','PC','<p><ul><li>Delivering the fastest charging speed for your smartphone, 0%~50% in only 30 minutes\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Complies with both Power Delivery (PD 3.0) and Quick Charge (QC 3.0) fast charge protocols: 5V ⎓ 3A, 9V ⎓ 2A, 12V ⎓ 1.5A\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Strong power output in compact size\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Travel-friendly with foldable pins\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>International power standard, 100-240V\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>100% safe charging: overcharging, overheating and short circuit protection</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(176,176,'iPhone 12 Pro 256GB','pc','<p></p><ul><li>Super Retina XDR display\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>6.1‑inch (diagonal) all‑screen OLED display\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>2532‑by‑1170-pixel resolution at 460 ppi\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>HDR display, True Tone.Wide color (P3)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Haptic Touch, 2,000,000:1 contrast ratio (typical)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>800 nits max brightness (typical); 1200 nits max brightness (HDR)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Fingerprint-resistant oleophobic coating\r\n</li></ul><p><ul><li>Support for display of multiple languages and characters simultaneously</li></ul><ul><li>1-year of breakage insurance</li></ul></p><p></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(177,177,'JBL Go 3 Portable Bluetooth Speaker','pc','<ul><li><ul><li>Bluetooth Wireless Technology\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Up to 5 Hours of Play Time\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>IP67 Waterproof and Dustproof Rating\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Up to 4.2W RMS Output\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>1.7 x 1.9\" Full-Range Driver\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Integrated Loop</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Enjoy Bluetooth wireless music streaming nearly anywhere, rain or shine, with the teal JBL Go 3 Portable Bluetooth Speaker. Bluetooth connectivity enables wireless audio streaming from your compatible smartphone, tablet, or other Bluetooth-capable device. A built-in loop lets you carry it around easily, and its IP67 rating means it\'s waterproof and dustproof for worry-free use at the beach, park, or pool. The speaker has a 1.7 x 1.9\" full-range driver that delivers up to 4.2W of RMS power.\r\n</p><p>Designed to deliver big audio and punchy bass from a compact design\r\n</p><p>A portable design, colorful fabric, and expressive details help the Go 3 look as good as it sounds\r\n</p><p>The Go 3 is waterproof and dustproof, so you can bring it to the pool, park, and just about everywhere\r\n</p><p>Stream music from your phone, tablet, or any compatible Bluetooth-enabled device wirelessly\r\n</p><p>The Go 3 provides up to five hours of play time on a single charge\r\n</p><p>Integrated loop lets you carry the Go 3 nearly anywhere\r\n</p><ul><li>2.5-hour charge time\r\n</li><li>JBL Go 3 Specs\r\n</li><li>Speaker System\r\n</li><li>Power Output	4.2 W\r\n</li><li>Drivers	1 x 1.69 x 1.85\" / 4.3 x 4.7 cm Full-Range\r\n</li><li>Frequency Response	110 Hz to 20 kHz\r\n</li><li>Signal to Noise Ratio	&gt;85 dB\r\n</li><li>Microphone\r\n</li><li>Built-In Mic	No\r\n</li><li>Bluetooth Connectivity\r\n</li><li>Bluetooth	5.1\r\n</li><li>Supported Bluetooth Profiles	A2DP 1.3\r\n</li><li>AVRCP 1.6\r\n</li><li>NFC	No\r\n</li><li>Transmitter Power	8 dBm\r\n</li><li>Bluetooth Transmitter Modulation	π/4 DQPSK, 8DPSK, GFSK\r\n</li><li>Additional Wireless Connectivity\r\n</li><li>Radio Tuner	None\r\n</li><li>Wired Connectivity\r\n</li><li>Inputs	None\r\n</li><li>Outputs	None\r\n</li><li>Battery\r\n</li><li>Battery Chemistry	Lithium-Ion Polymer (LiPo)\r\n</li><li>Battery Voltage	5 V\r\n</li><li>Expected Battery Life	5 Hour\r\n</li><li>Physical\r\n</li><li>Memory Card Slot	None\r\n</li><li>IP Rating	IP67\r\n</li><li>Dimensions (W x H x D)	3.46 x 2.95 x 1.61\" / 8.8 x 7.5 x 4.1 cm\r\n</li><li>Weight	7.37 oz / 209 g\r\n</li><li>Packaging Info\r\n</li><li>Package Weight	0.65 lb\r\n</li><li>Box Dimensions (LxWxH)	5.1 x 3.5 x 1.9\"\r\n</li><li>In the Box\r\n</li><li>JBL Go 3 Portable Bluetooth Speaker (Teal)\r\n</li><li>USB Type-C Cable</li></ul><p>\r\n</p></li></ul>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(178,178,'Apple AirPods with Charging Case (2nd Generation)','pc','<p><ul><li>For iPhone, Apple Watch, iPad, and Mac\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Bluetooth &amp; H1 Headphone Chip\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Voice-Enabled \"Hey Siri\" Support\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>One-Tap Setup; Auto On and Auto Connect\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Dual Beamforming Microphones\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Up to 5 Hours of Listening Time\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Double Tap to Control Playback\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Built-In Sensors and Accelerometers\r\n</li></ul></p><ul><li>Charging Case Included\r\n</li></ul><p><br></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(179,179,'Apple 20W USB-C Power Adapter','PC','<p>The Apple 20W USB‑C Power Adapter offers fast, efficient charging at home, in the office, or on the go. While the power adapter is compatible with any USB‑C-enabled device, Apple recommends pairing it with the iPad Pro and iPad Air for optimal charging performance. You can also pair it with iPhone 8 or later to take advantage of the fast-charging feature.\r\n</p><p>Charging cable sold separately.\r\n</p><p><b>What’s in the Box\r\n</b></p><p>Apple 18W USB-C Power Adapter\r\n</p><p>Compatibility \r\n</p><p><b>iPhone Models\r\n</b></p><p>iPhone 12 Pro\r\n</p><p>iPhone 12 Pro Max\r\n</p><p>iPhone 12 mini\r\n</p><p>iPhone 12\r\n</p><p>iPhone 11 Pro\r\n</p><p>iPhone 11 Pro Max\r\n</p><p>iPhone 11\r\n</p><p>iPhone SE (2nd generation)\r\n</p><p>iPhone XS\r\n</p><p>iPhone XS Max\r\n</p><p>iPhone XR\r\n</p><p>iPhone X\r\n</p><p>iPhone 8\r\n</p><p>iPhone 8 Plus\r\n</p><p><b>iPad Models\r\n</b></p><p>iPad Pro 12.9-inch (4th generation)\r\n</p><p>iPad Pro 12.9-inch (3rd generation)\r\n</p><p>iPad Pro 12.9-inch (2nd generation)\r\n</p><p>iPad Pro 12.9-inch (1st generation)\r\n</p><p>iPad Pro 11-inch (2nd generation)\r\n</p><p>iPad Pro 11-inch (1st generation)\r\n</p><p>iPad Pro 10.5-inch\r\n</p><p>iPad Air (4th generation)\r\n</p><p>iPad Air (3rd generation)\r\n</p><p>iPad (8th generation)\r\n</p><p>iPad (7th generation)\r\n</p><p>iPad mini (5th generation)</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(180,180,'JBL Clip 3 Portable Bluetooth Speaker','pc','<p>Bluetooth Wireless Streaming\r\n</p><p>IPX7 Rated\r\n</p><p>Waterproof in up to 3.3\' of Water\r\n</p><p>Can Double as a Speakerphone\r\n</p><p>Noise-Canceling Microphone\r\n</p><p>Rechargeable Lithium-Ion Polymer Battery</p><p>Built-In Carabiner Clip<br></p><p>LED Indicators\r\n</p><p>Up to 10 Hours of Battery Life</p><p><br></p><p>Bring the party poolside, to the beach, or wherever you go this summer with the Desert Sand Clip 3 Portable Bluetooth Speaker. At 5.4 inches, this compact Bluetooth speaker streams music from your phone or tablet and even features noise-cancelling speakerphone technology to allow for clear phone calls. This speaker is water-resistant and able to withstand being submerged in up to 3.3 feet of water for 30 minutes thanks to its IPX7 rating. This portable speaker is designed with a built-in carabiner clip, so you can easily attach this speaker to your backpack, belt loop, and more. On a full charge, the JBL Clip 3 gives you up to 10 hours of playback, but if you use the included micro-USB cable you can recharge the speaker, so the music never has to stop.\r\n</p><p><b>More Ways to Connect \r\n</b></p><p>Don\'t worry if Bluetooth is not available, plug an audio cable into the JBL Clip 3 and enjoy your music all the same.\r\n</p><p><b>Clip it Anywhere \r\n</b></p><p>The fully integrated metal carabiner is designed to protect the speaker from damage and allows you to easily hook the speaker onto your backpack or belt loop.\r\n</p><p><b>Made for Your Adventures \r\n</b></p><p>The JBL Clip 3 features an improved, durable fabric material and rugged rubber housing that protects your speaker on all your adventures.\r\n</p><p><b>LED Indicators \r\n</b></p><p>The LED indicators inform you when the speaker is low on power, charging, in pairing mode, or receiving an incoming call. It also notifies you when the speaker is not connected via Bluetooth or if you are taking a phone call.\r\n</p><p><b>In the Box\r\n</b></p><p>JBL Clip 3 Portable Bluetooth Speaker\r\n</p><p>Micro-USB Charge Cable\r\n</p><p>Limited 1-Year Warranty</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(181,181,'Apple AirPods with Charging Case (2nd Generation)','PC','<p><ul><li>For iPhone, Apple Watch, iPad, and Mac\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Bluetooth &amp; H1 Headphone Chip\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Voice-Enabled \"Hey Siri\" Support\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>One-Tap Setup; Auto On and Auto Connect\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Dual Beamforming Microphones\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Up to 5 Hours of Listening Time\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Double Tap to Control Playback\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Built-In Sensors and Accelerometers\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Charging Case Included</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(182,182,'Apple AirPods with Wireless Charging Case (2nd Generation)','pc','<p><ul><li>For iPhone, Apple Watch, iPad, and Mac\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Bluetooth &amp; H1 Headphone Chip\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Voice-Enabled \"Hey Siri\" Support\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>One-Tap Setup; Auto On and Auto Connect\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Dual Beamforming Microphones\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Up to 5 Hours of Listening Time\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Double Tap to Control Playback\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Built-In Sensors and Accelerometers\r\n</li></ul></p><ul><li>Qi-Compatible Wireless Charging Case\r\n</li></ul><p><br></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(183,183,'Apple AirPods with Wireless Charging Case (2nd Generation)','PC','<p><ul><li>For iPhone, Apple Watch, iPad, and Mac\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Bluetooth &amp; H1 Headphone Chip\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Voice-Enabled \"Hey Siri\" Support\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>One-Tap Setup; Auto On and Auto Connect\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Dual Beamforming Microphones\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Up to 5 Hours of Listening Time\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Double Tap to Control Playback\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Built-In Sensors and Accelerometers\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Qi-Compatible Wireless Charging Case</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(184,184,'Apple EarPods with Remote and Mic','pc','<p><ul><li>Enhanced Bass Response\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Resistant to Sweat and Water Damage\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Control Music and Video Playback\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Answer and End Calls</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(185,185,'JBL Clip 4 Portable Bluetooth Speaker','pc','<p><ul><li>Bluetooth Wireless Streaming\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>IP67 Rated, Waterproof and Dustproof\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Built-In 10-Hour Rechargeable Battery\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Integrated Carabiner\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>USB Type-C Charging</li></ul></p><p>Bring the party nearly anywhere you go with the squad JBL Clip 4 Portable Bluetooth Speaker. With a built-in carabiner and rechargeable battery that lasts up to 10 hours, you can clip the speaker to your bag, belt loop, or whatever else is handy and stream music, podcasts, and more wirelessly via Bluetooth as you travel. Its IP67 rating means it\'s waterproof and dustproof, so it\'s safe at the beach or poolside, even if it rains or gets splashed. It outputs up to 5W from its 1.5\" driver.\r\n</p><p><b>Portable Design\r\n</b></p><p>The Clip 4 features a portable design with a built-in carabiner, so you can clip it to your belt, bag strap, or buckle, and take it nearly anywhere. It\'s engineered to deliver rich audio and punchy bass, despite its compact size.\r\n</p><p>IP67 Waterproof and Dustproof\r\n</p><p>The Clip 4 is IP67 rated to be waterproof and dustproof, so you can bring it to the pool, park, or wherever.\r\n</p><p>Bluetooth Wireless Streaming\r\n</p><p>Stream music wirelessly from your phone, tablet, or any other compatible Bluetooth-enabled device.\r\n</p><p>Up to 10-Hour Battery Life\r\n</p><p>With up to 10 hours of battery life on a single charge, you can play music without worrying about recharging.\r\n</p><p>Additional Features\r\n</p><p><ul><li>Oval shape designed to fit easily into your hand\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Fully wrapped in fabric\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>3-hour charge time\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>JBL Clip 4 Specs\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Speaker System\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Power Output	5 W\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Drivers	1 x 1.57\" / 4 cm\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Frequency Response	100 Hz to 20 kHz\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Signal to Noise Ratio	&gt;85 dB\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Microphone\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Built-In Mic	No\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Bluetooth Connectivity\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Bluetooth	5.1\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Supported Bluetooth Profiles	A2DP 1.3\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>AVRCP 1.6\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>NFC	No\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Transmitter Power	10 dBm\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Bluetooth Transmitter Modulation	π/4 DQPSK, 8DPSK, GFSK\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Additional Wireless Connectivity\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Radio Tuner	None\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Wired Connectivity\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Inputs	1 x USB Type-C (Power)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Outputs	None\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Battery\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Battery Chemistry	Lithium-Ion Polymer (LiPo)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Battery Voltage	5 V\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Expected Battery Life	10 Hour\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Physical\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>IP Rating	IP67\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Dimensions (W x H x D)	3.39 x 5.31 x 1.81\" / 8.6 x 13.5 x 4.6 cm\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Weight	8.43 oz / 239 g\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>In the Box\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>JBL Clip 4 Portable Bluetooth Speaker (Squad)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>USB Type-C Cable</li></ul></p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(186,186,'Apple EarPods with Lightning Connector','PC','<p><b>Overview\r\n</b></p><p>Unlike traditional, circular earbuds, the design of the EarPods is defined by the geometry of the ear. Which makes them more comfortable for more people than any other earbud-style headphones.\r\n</p><p>The speakers inside the EarPods have been engineered to maximize sound output and minimize sound loss, which means you get high-quality audio.\r\n</p><p>The EarPods with Lightning Connector also include a built-in remote that lets you adjust the volume, control the playback of music and video, and answer or end calls with a pinch of the cord.\r\n</p><p><b>Highlights\r\n</b></p><p>Designed by Apple\r\n</p><p>Deeper, richer bass tones\r\n</p><p>Greater protection from sweat and water\r\n</p><p>Control music and video playback\r\n</p><p>Answer and end calls\r\n</p><p><b>What’s in the Box\r\n</b></p><p>EarPods with Lightning Connector\r\n</p><p><b>Tech Specs\r\n</b></p><p>General\r\n</p><p>With Remote and Mic\r\n</p><p><b>System Requirements\r\n</b></p><p>Works with all devices that have a Lightning connector and support iOS 10 or later, including iPod touch, iPad, and iPhone.</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(187,187,'iPhone 12 Pro 512GB','pc','<p></p><ul><li>Super Retina XDR display\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>6.1‑inch (diagonal) all‑screen OLED display\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>2532‑by‑1170-pixel resolution at 460 ppi\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>HDR display, True Tone.Wide color (P3)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Haptic Touch, 2,000,000:1 contrast ratio (typical)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>800 nits max brightness (typical); 1200 nits max brightness (HDR)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Fingerprint-resistant oleophobic coating\r\n</li></ul><p><ul><li>Support for display of multiple languages and characters simultaneously</li></ul><ul><li>1-year of breakage insurance</li></ul></p><p></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(188,188,'Apple EarPods with Remote and Mic','PC','<p><ul><li>Enhanced Bass Response\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Resistant to Sweat and Water Damage\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Control Music and Video Playback\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Answer and End Calls</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(189,189,'ViewSonic M1 Mini 50-Lumen WVGA DLP Pico Projector','pc','<ul><li>50 ANSI Lumen, 120 LED Lumen Brightness\r\n</li><li>WVGA 854 x 480 Native Resolution\r\n</li><li>120,000:1 Dynamic Contrast Ratio\r\n</li><li>Up to 30,000-Hour LED Life\r\n</li><li>HDMI Input\r\n</li><li>USB Host Reader\r\n</li><li>Integrated 2W Speaker\r\n</li><li>Up to 2.5-Hour Battery Life</li></ul>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(190,190,'Harman Kardon Neo Portable Bluetooth speaker','pc','<p><b>BEAUTIFUL SOUND IN A SMALL PACKAGE\r\n</b></p><p>The exquisitely-designed Harman Kardon Neo delivers the premium sound you expect from Harman Kardon, yet is small enough to fit in your hand.</p><p><b>WIRELESS BLUETOOTH STREAMING\r\n</b></p><p>The Bluetooth-enabled Harman Kardon Neo makes it easy to connect your compatible device of choice and continue to stream your favourite tunes in rich, premium sound.\r\n</p><p><b>UP TO 10 HOURS OF PLAYTIME\r\n</b></p><p>The Harman Kardon Neo is something you\'ll want to take everywhere. The rechargeable battery supports up to 10 hours of playtime. Enjoy beautiful sound anywhere.\r\n</p><p><b>IPX7 WATERPROOF\r\n</b></p><p>There\'s no need to worry about the weather or household mishaps. Harman Kardon Neo is protected by an IPX7 waterproof rating.\r\n</p><p><b>ELEGANT AND RESILIENT\r\n</b></p><p>Impeccably crafted from durable metal, to withstand a few scrapes, it\'s the perfect blend of form and function. With three sophisticated colour options, each with sturdy straps, Harman Kardon Neo invigorates your music without sacrificing your style.\r\n</p><p><b>NEVER MISS A CALL AGAIN\r\n</b></p><p>Take your calls with the push of a button. Hear the difference with an echo-cancelling, crystal clear speakerphone.\r\n</p><p>Exquisite Harman Kardon sound in a compact, elegant package.\r\n</p><p>Harman Kardon Neo delivers impeccable sound in a palm-sized, portable package. Compact, sleek and IPX7 waterproof, this ultra-portable speaker can play continuously for up to 10 hours, while its echo-cancelling speakerphone ensures crystal-clear phone calls. Available in three colors, the Harman Kardon Neo is easily transportable by its sturdy strap. On your desk or in the backyard, the Harman Kardon Neo fits beautifully anywhere.</p><p> \r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(191,191,'Apple Lightning Digital AV Adapter','PC','<p>Use the Lightning Digital AV Adapter with your iPad with Retina display, iPad mini, iPhone 5, and iPod touch (5th generation) with Lightning connector. The Lightning Digital AV Adapter supports mirroring of what is displayed on your device screen — including apps, presentations, websites, slideshows, and more — to your HDMI-equipped TV, display, projector, or other compatible display in up to 1080p HD. It also outputs video content — movies, TV shows, captured video — to your big screen in up to 1080p HD. Simply attach the Lightning Digital AV Adapter to the Lightning connector on your device and then to your TV or projector via an HDMI cable (sold separately). What\'s in the Box? Lightning Digital AV Adapter System Requirements Requires an HDMI cable (sold separately) for connection to your TV or projector. Supports both video and audio output.</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(192,192,'Apple Lightning Digital AV Adapter','pc','<p>Use the Lightning Digital AV Adapter with your iPad with Retina display, iPad mini, iPhone 5, and iPod touch (5th generation) with Lightning connector.</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(193,193,'JBL Tuner 2 Portable DAB/DAB+/FM radio with Bluetooth','pc','<ul><li><ul><li>Crystal clear sound\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Wireless Bluetooth streaming\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Up to 12 hours of playtime</li></ul><p>Crystal clear sound\r\n</p><p>From news and weather to music and entertainment, enjoy all your favorite radio stations on digital DAB/DAB+ and FM frequencies in crystal clear JBL Pro Sound.\r\n</p><p>Wireless Bluetooth streaming\r\n</p><p>Listen to everything you love. Connect the JBL Tuner 2 to your smartphone or tablet via Bluetooth and quickly switch from radio to your playlists.\r\n</p><p>Up to 12 hours of playtime\r\n</p><p>Tune in longer. The built-in battery lets you enjoy your favorite stations for up to 12 hours.\r\n</p><p>Crystal clear radio sound anywhere\r\n</p><p>In the kitchen. By the pool. At the park. Now you can take your favorite DAB/DAB+/FM radio stations wherever the day takes you. The sleek JBL Tuner 2 is a compact, portable radio with crystal clear sound, Bluetooth and up to 12 hours of playtime. Quickly tune to your favorite stations with 5 preset buttons and easy-to-read station information on the scrolling LCD display. It\'s rated IPX7 waterproof and ready for the outdoors, so even in a sudden rainstorm, there\'s no need to stress. Listen for hours. From news and weather in the morning, to music and entertainment at night.\r\n</p><p><ul><li>Transducer1 x 1.75\"\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Rated output power5W RMS\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>DAB Tuning range174.928MHz – 239.200MHz (Band-III)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>FM Tuning range87.5MHz – 108MHz (varies by countries)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Frequency response80Hz-20KHz (-6dB)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Signal-to-noise ratio&gt;80dB\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Battery typeLithium-ion polymer 9.075 Wh\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Battery charge time3.5 hours (5V / 0.9A)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Charging Input5V, 1.2A\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Music playing timeup to 12 hours for radio listening (dependent on volume level and audio content)</li></ul></p><p> \r\n</p><p> \r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p></li></ul>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(194,194,'Apple Lightning to SD Card Camera Reader','PC','<p>The Lightning to SD Card Camera Reader from Apple makes it possible to download photos and videos from your digital camera to your device so you can view them on the tablet\'s display. It is compatible with Lightning-enabled iOS devices running iOS 9.2 and later. After you insert the SD card into the reader, your device automatically opens the Photos app, which lets you choose which photos and videos to import, then organizes them into albums. When you sync with your PC or Mac, the photos and videos on your iPad are added to your computer\'s photo library. The Lightning to SD card reader supports standard photo formats including JPEG and RAW, as well as SD and HD video formats including H.264 and MPEG-4. iPad Pro users will benefit from data transfer speeds rivaling USB 3.0.\r\n</p><p>In the Box\r\n</p><p>Apple Lightning to SD Card Camera Reader\r\n</p><ul><li>1-Year Warranty</li></ul><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(195,195,'Apple Lightning to SD Card Camera Reader','pc','<p><ul><li>For Lightning-Enabled iOS Devices\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>View Photos from SD Card\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Supports JPEG, RAW\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Supports H.264 &amp; MPEG-4\r\n</li></ul></p><ul><li>Up to USB 3.0 Speeds on iPad Pro\r\n</li></ul><p><br></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(196,196,'Apple Lightning to USB Cable (1 m)','PC','<p><b>Overview\r\n</b></p><p>This USB 2.0 cable connects your iPhone, iPad, or iPod with Lightning connector to your computer’s USB port for syncing and charging. Or you can connect to the Apple USB Power Adapter for convenient charging from a wall outlet.\r\n</p><p><b>Highlights\r\n</b></p><p>Reversible design\r\n</p><p><b>What’s in the Box\r\n</b></p><p>Apple Lightning to USB Cable</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(197,197,'Apple Lightning to USB Camera Adapter','pc','<p>With the Lightning to USB Camera Adapter, it\'s easy to download photos and videos from your digital camera to your iPad with Retina display or iPad mini, so you can view them on the gorgeous iPad display and share them with family and friends.</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(198,198,'Apple MagSafe Charger','PC','<p>Charging is a snap with the MagSafe Charger from Apple. This magnetic charger snaps to the back of an iPhone 12, 12 Pro, or 12 Pro Max with a satisfying click, delivering up to 15W of charging power with a standard charger, or up to 20W with an optional 20W USB Type-C adapter. Simply plug in the MagSafe Charger\'s attached 3.3\' USB Type-C cable. Please note that a power adapter is required and none are included. This charger is also compatible with MagSafe Apple cases and Qi-certified chargers. Wireless charge an iPhone 8, AirPod case, or other compatible devices.\r\n</p><p><b>Apple MagSafe Charger Specs\r\n</b></p><p>Wireless Charging Power	20 W\r\n</p><p>Wireless Charging Technology	Qi\r\n</p><p>Cable Length	3.3\' / 1 m\r\n</p><p>Packaging Info\r\n</p><p>Package Weight	0.185 lb\r\n</p><p>Box Dimensions (LxWxH)	3.3 x 3.2 x 0.7\"\r\n</p><p><b>In the Box\r\n</b></p><p>Apple MagSafe Charger\r\n</p><p>Limited 1-Year Warranty</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(199,199,'ViewSonic M1+ 300-Lumen WVGA LED DLP Smart Pico Projector','pc','<ul><li>Maximum Brightness of 300 Lumens\r\n</li><li>WVGA 854 x 480 Native Resolution\r\n</li><li>120,000:1 Dynamic Contrast Ratio\r\n</li><li>Up to 30,000-Hour LED Life\r\n</li><li>Integrated Wi-Fi &amp; Bluetooth\r\n</li><li>Smart TV Functionality\r\n</li><li>USB Type-C and HDMI Video Inputs\r\n</li><li>microSD &amp; USB Host Reader\r\n</li><li>Dual 3-Watt Speakers\r\n</li><li>Up to 6-Hour Battery Life</li></ul>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(200,200,'Apple Lightning to VGA Adapter','pc','<p>Use the Lightning to VGA Adapter with your iPad with Retina display, iPad mini, iPhone 5, and iPod touch (5th generation) with Lightning connector.</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(201,201,'JBL Flip 5 Waterproof Bluetooth Speaker','pc','<p><ul><li>Speaker System\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Power Output	20 W\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Frequency Response	65 Hz to 20 kHz\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Signal to Noise Ratio	&gt;80 dB\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Bluetooth Connectivity\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Bluetooth	4.2\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Supported Bluetooth Profiles	A2DP 1.3\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>AVRCP 1.6\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>NFC	No\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Transmitter Power	11 dBm\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Bluetooth Transmitter Modulation	π/4 DQPSK, 8DPSK, GFSK\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Wired Connectivity\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Inputs	1 x USB Type-C (Power)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Outputs	None\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Battery\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Capacity (mAh)	4800 mAh\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Battery Chemistry	Lithium-Ion Polymer (LiPo)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Battery Voltage	3.6 V\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Expected Battery Life	12 Hours\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Power\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>DC Input Power	5 VDC at 3 A\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Physical\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Memory Card Slot	None\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>IP Rating	IPX7\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Dimensions (W x H x D)	7.13 x 2.91 x 2.72\" / 181 x 74 x 69 mm\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Weight	1.19 lb / 540 g\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Packaging Info\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Package Weight	1.655 lb\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Box Dimensions (LxWxH)	8.7 x 4.3 x 4.1\"\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>In the Box\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>JBL Flip 5 Waterproof Bluetooth Speaker (Ocean Blue)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>USB Type-C Cable\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Limited 1-Year Warranty</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(202,202,'JCPAL Joy Color iPad Pro Case 12.9\"','pc','<p>Precisely manufactured using high quality materials, the Casense easy access to all the buttons and camera functions of your iPad, without needingto remove it from the case. Classic Case provides complete protection for your iPad Pro.The Casense Classic cover has been lined with ultra soft material, protecting your iPad Pro’s display from scratches.The precisely molded polycarbonate shell features cutouts allowing\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(203,203,'Moshi Mythro LT Earbuds Lightning earphones- Jet Silver','PC','<p>Moshi\'s Mythro LT are stylish Lightning in-ear earphones imbued with minimalist aesthetics and a vibrant sonic presence. Encased in a strong and lightweight aluminum housing, Moshi\'s DR8 Neodymium driver delivers crisp highs and deep punchy bass. The earbuds are equipped with a built-in digital-to-analog converter (DAC) and an integrated MEMS microphone with 3-button controls so you can answer calls, or activate Siri on the go. The in-ear design coupled with our proprietary hybrid-injection ear tips effectively block out external ambient noise while providing hours of comfortable listening.\r\n</p><p><b>Product\r\n</b></p><p>Mythro LT Earbuds\r\n</p><p><b>P/N\r\n</b></p><p>99MO035224\r\n</p><p><b>Product Weight\r\n</b></p><p>0.63 oz (18 g)\r\n</p><p><b>Package Weight (include product)\r\n</b></p><p>1.97 oz (56 g)\r\n</p><p><b>Cable Length\r\n</b></p><p>3.9 ft (1.2 m)\r\n</p><p><b>Transducer Unit\r\n</b></p><p>DR8 full range 8mm neodymium driver\r\n</p><p><b>Cavity/housing\r\n</b></p><p>aluminum\r\n</p><p><b>Sensitivity\r\n</b></p><p>100 +/- 3dB @ 1kHz\r\n</p><p><b>Frequency Response\r\n</b></p><p>15 - 20,000Hz (-10dB @ 1kHz)\r\n</p><p><b>Ear-coupling Type\r\n</b></p><p>canal-fit silicone\r\n</p><p>Noise isolation (passive)\r\n</p><p>up to 23dB\r\n</p><p><b>In-line control\r\n</b></p><p>3-button controls with mic\r\n</p><p><b>Wearing type\r\n</b></p><p>In-Ear\r\n</p><p><b>EAN\r\n</b></p><p>4713057256301\r\n</p><p><b>UPC\r\n</b></p><p>888112000886\r\n</p><p><b>Compatibility\r\n</b></p><p>Compatible with iPhone/iPad/iPod touch with Lightning connector and iOS 10 or later</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(204,204,'Nebula Mars II Pro','pc','<ul><li>500 ANSI lm\r\n</li><li>HD Picture\r\n</li><li>Dual 10W Speakers\r\n</li><li>Horizontal and Vertical Keystoning\r\n</li><li>Extensive Connectivity\r\n</li><li>Android 7.1</li></ul>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(205,205,'JCPAL Joy Color iPad Pro Case 9.7\"','pc','<p>Precisely manufactured using high quality materials, the Casense easy access to all the buttons and camera functions of your iPad, without needingto remove it from the case. Classic Case provides complete protection for your iPad Pro.The Casense Classic cover has been lined with ultra soft material, protecting your iPad Pro’s display from scratches.The precisely molded polycarbonate shell features cutouts allowing</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(206,206,'Moshi Integra Lightning to 3.5 mm Headphone Jack Adapter','PC','<p>Moshi’s MFi-certified Integra™ Headphone Jack Adapter lets you listen to music and take calls from your iPhone or iPad’s Lightning port using regular headphones. As part of Moshi’s Integra Series, the adapter’s IntegraCore spine is constructed using high-performance aramid fiber to withstand extreme bends at any angle. Its ballistic nylon sleeve is abrasion-resistant to prevent splitting, while anodized aluminum housings help minimize electromagnetic interference. Stylish and more durable than Apple’s offering, this adapter is also fitted with reinforced stress relief points for extra long life.\r\n</p><p><b>Product\r\n</b></p><p>Integra Lightning to 3.5 mm Headphone Jack Adapter\r\n</p><p><b>P/N\r\n</b></p><p>99MO023131\r\n</p><p><b>Product Weight\r\n</b></p><p>0.17 oz (5 g)\r\n</p><p><b>Package Weight (include product)\r\n</b></p><p>0.59 oz (17 g)\r\n</p><p><b>Cable Length\r\n</b></p><p>4.33\" (11 cm)\r\n</p><p><b>EAN\r\n</b></p><p>4713057253737\r\n</p><p><b>UPC\r\n</b></p><p>810648019360\r\n</p><p><b>Compatibility\r\n</b></p><p>Made for\r\n</p><ul><li>iPhone X, iPhone 8 Plus, iPhone 8\r\n</li><li>iPhone 7 Plus, iPhone 7, iPhone SE\r\n</li><li>iPhone 6s Plus, iPhone 6s, iPhone 6 Plus, iPhone 6\r\n</li><li>iPhone 5s, iPhone 5c, iPhone 5\r\n</li><li>iPad Pro (10.5-inch), iPad Pro (12.9-inch) 2nd Generation\r\n</li><li>iPad Pro (12.9-inch) 1st Generation, iPad Pro (9.7-inch)\r\n</li><li>iPad mini 4, iPad Air 2, iPad mini 3, iPad Air\r\n</li><li>iPad mini 2, iPad (5th generation), iPod touch (6th generation)</li></ul><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(207,207,'Moshi Integra Lightning to 3.5 mm Headphone Jack Adapter','pc','<p><ul><li>Listen to music on your iPhone or iPad device (iOS 10 or later) using regular 3.5 mm headphones.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Protocol pass-through to control your music (pause/play/take calls) on the go.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Reinforced IntegraCore™ spine for extreme durability.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Ballistic nylon braided sleeve for superior abrasion and tangle resistance.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Anodized aluminum housings with reinforced stress relief points.</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(208,208,'JBL Horizon 2 Clock Radio with Bluetooth','pc','<p><b>Audio Specification\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Drivers	2x 1.5\" / 38 mm (Full-Range)\r\n</li><li>Power Output per Channel	4 W RMS\r\n</li><li>Frequency Response	75 Hz to 20 kHz (-6 dB)\r\n</li><li>Signal-to-Noise Ratio	&gt;80 dB\r\n</li></ul><p><b>Bluetooth Specifications\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Bluetooth Version	4.2\r\n</li><li>Bluetooth Profile Support	A2DP V1.3, AVRCP V1.6\r\n</li><li>Bluetooth Frequency	2.4 to 2.4835 GHz\r\n</li><li>Bluetooth Transmitter Power	0 to 7 dBm (EIRP)\r\n</li><li>Bluetooth Transmitter Modulation	GFSK/π/4 DQPSK/8DPSK\r\n</li></ul><p><b>Tuner\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Tuner Type	FM\r\n</li><li>Frequency	76 to 108 MHz\r\n</li></ul><p><b>Connectivity\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Inputs	1 x FM Antenna\r\n</li><li>Outputs	2 x USB Type-A (5 V, 2 A Max)</li></ul><p><b>Physical Specifications</b></p><ul><li>Power Requirements	13 VDC, 2.2 A\r\n</li><li>Backup Battery	CR2032\r\n</li><li>Dimensions (W x H x D)	7 x 6.4 x 3\" / 178 x 162 x 75.7 mm\r\n</li><li>Weight	1.78 lb / 810 g\r\n</li><li>Packaging Info\r\n</li><li>Package Weight	2.985 lb\r\n</li><li>Box Dimensions (LxWxH)	8.2 x 7.8 x 5.9\"\r\n</li></ul><p><b>In the Box\r\n</b></p><ul><li>JBL Horizon 2 Clock Radio with Bluetooth (Black)\r\n</li><li>Pigtail FM Antenna\r\n</li><li>Power Adapter\r\n</li><li>Limited 1-Year Warranty</li></ul>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(209,209,'BRAVEN BRV-X Bluetooth Speaker','pc','<p><b>BRAVEN BRV-X\r\n</b></p><p>Designed for outdoor enthusiasts, the BRAVEN BRV-X booms with 12 hours of music playtime, which is perfect for rocky canyons, powdered slopes, raging rapids, sandy dunes or even backyard barbecues. The BRV-X is designed with an IPX7 certified waterproof, shock absorbent, portable body and features a powerful 5200mAh power bank to charge external devices. Customize your listening experience for any environment by choosing indoor or outdoor mode. For an immersive left and right stereo experience, pair two BRAVEN BRV-X speakers together using True Wireless™.\r\n</p><p><b>IPX7 Waterproof\r\n</b></p><p>With an IPX7 certified waterproof rating, the BRV-X is protected from rainfall, splashing and can be fully submersed in water one meter deep for up to 30 minutes. Its rugged exterior and impact-resistant frame make it ready for any adventure.\r\n</p><p><b>True Wireless™ Technology\r\n</b></p><p>Take your outdoor listening experience further with the BRV-X Speaker\'s ability to wirelessly pair to a second speaker. Once paired, rock out in left and right stereo sound.\r\n</p><p><b>Dual Audio Modes\r\n</b></p><p>Optimized playback modes can be adjusted for indoor or outdoor listening environments. Outdoor mode provides bright, long-range audio, while indoor mode creates rich sound with deep, full bass.\r\n</p><p><b>Connections\r\n</b></p><p><ul><li>3.5 mm Stereo Input\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Micro-USB-to-USB data ports\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Wireless Pairing\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Audio\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Indoor and Outdoor mode\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Built-in microphone &amp; speakerphone\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Power\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>On/Off buttons\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>12 hour playtime\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>5200mAh rechargeable lithium-ion battery\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Size\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Dimensions: 9.06in x 3.63in x 2.94in\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Weight: 1.5lbs\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Profiles Supported\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>IOPT/HFP 1.5\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>A2DP 1.0\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>AVRCP 1.4\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>GAVDP 1.0\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>HSP 1.2\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Weatherproof\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>IPX3 Certified\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>In The Box\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>BRAVEN BRV-HD Bluetooth Speaker\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>BRV-X Travel Strap\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>AC power supply adapter plugs (US/EU/UK/AU)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>3.5mm stereo AUX cable</li></ul></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(210,210,'Moshi Mythro C USB Type-C Earphones','pc','<p>These USB Type-C earphones deliver crisp highs and deep punchy bass. A built-in digital-to-analog converter (DAC) offers high-resolution sound and the headphones feature 4-button controls with microphone, DJ Boost™, and Google Assistant support.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(211,211,'ViewSonic PX747-4K Home Theater Projector','pc','<ul><li>Brightness of 3500 ANSI Lumens\r\n</li><li>UHD 4K 3840 x 2160 On-Screen Resolution\r\n</li><li>Supports HDR Content\r\n</li><li>SuperColor Technology\r\n</li><li>10W Internal Speaker\r\n</li><li>Dual HDMI Inputs\r\n</li><li>1.2x Optical Zoom\r\n</li><li>15,000 Hours Lamp Life in SuperEco Mode\r\n</li><li>Includes Backlit Remote Control</li></ul>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:17','2026-07-18 07:18:17'),(212,212,'ViewSonic M2 LED Full HD Smart DLP Projector','pc','<ul><li>Brightness of 1200 LED Lumens\r\n</li><li>Full HD 1920 x 1080 Native Resolution\r\n</li><li>1.23:1 Throw Ratio\r\n</li><li>Up to 30,000-Hour LED Life\r\n</li><li>Wi-Fi Connectivity via Included Adapter\r\n</li><li>Smart TV Functionality\r\n</li><li>HDMI, USB Type-A, USB Type-C Inputs\r\n</li><li>microSD Card Slot\r\n</li><li>USB &amp; microSD Multimedia Playback\r\n</li><li>Dual 3W Harman Kardon Speakers</li></ul>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:18','2026-07-18 07:18:18'),(213,213,'Braven BRV-BLADE Portable Bluetooth Speaker','pc','<p><ul><li>22 Hous of Continuous Playtime\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>4000 mAh Battery Bank Backup for Charging USB-powered Devices\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>IPX7 Certified Waterproof, Dirt Proof, Sand Proof - the Rugged design is built for any and all weather conditions</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18: