eight: 170g\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Display technology	‎: AMOLED\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Other display features : ‎Wireless\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Other camera features : ‎Rear, Front\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Form factor	‎: Smartphone\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Colour	‎ : Charcoal Ink\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Battery Power Rating : ‎4500\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Whats in the box&nbsp; :‎OnePlus Nord CE 5G, Warp Charge 30T power adapter, Warp Type-C cable (Supports USB 2.0), Phone case, Screen protector (pre-applied), SIM tray ejector, Welcome letter, Brand sticker, Red Cable Club Membership card, Quick start guide, Safety information and warranty card, Highest SAR value &amp; Plastic recycling card</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:18','2026-07-18 07:18:18'),(296,296,'ITSKINS HYBRID TEK For iPhone 12 Pro Max','PC','<p>Sometimes, it\'s all about the optics. You know the quality of your phone and the protection of ITSKINS cases. Now show them both off. The semi-transparent armor backing of the HYBRID TEK is the headliner here. Allowing the natural colors of your phone to show through while still shouting \"peep this protection!\"\r\n</p><p>The innovative construction of all HYBRID TEK cases can be seen along any angle. From the optical-grade carbon-textured acrylic armored backing to the impact-cushioning Air Pocket edges. It\'s this HEXO-TEK™ 2.0 air pocket technology that provides the unparalleled 3m / 10 Ft Drop Protection that you can count on.</p><p><ul><li>3m/10 ft Drop certified\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Raised Corners\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Ultra Soft and flex\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Engineered Shock Absorbing Design\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Antimicrobial Defence</li></ul></p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:18','2026-07-18 07:18:18'),(297,297,'ITSKINS HYBRID CLEAR For iPhone 12 Pro Max','PC','<p>Show off. Stay protected. Melding a high-impact, optical-grade polycarbonate back for added strength and our impact-absorbing polymer edging with HEXOTEK 2.0 air pocket technology.\r\n</p><p>HYBRIDCLEAR is our stunning new SLIM Armor Case with Attitude.  Air Pocket Technology means all Impact/Drops/Knocks are dispersed through the sides, corners and ends of the case, making the Phone truly Drop Safe.\r\n</p><p>Slim and Protective</p><p><ul><li>3m/10 ft Drop certified\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Raised Corners\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Ultra Soft and flex\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Engineered Shock Absorbing Design</li></ul></p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:18','2026-07-18 07:18:18'),(298,298,'JCPAL DuraPro Protective Folio Case for iPad 10.2\"','pc','<p>The slim and lightweight DuraPro Protective Folio Case provides elegant protection for your iPad. Featuring a folding stand cover that supports multiple viewing angles, and a flexible and highly protective silicone shell with a compartment for your Apple Pencil, the case provides complete protection without restricting access to the iPads buttons or functions.\r\n</p><p><ul><li>Built-in Apple Pencil holder\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Compatible with Pencil charge/sync\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Multi-angle adjustable stand\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Water resistant cover supports iPad auto-wake/sleep functionality\r\n</li></ul></p><ul><li>Shock absorbing frame offers 360° protection\r\n</li></ul><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:18','2026-07-18 07:18:18'),(299,299,'RhinoShield Mod NX iPhone Case for 12 Pro Max','PC','<p>With the Mod NX iPhone 11Pro Case from RhinoShield, you get a snug-fitting case that\'s designed to protect your phone from drops utilizing ShockSpread material. ShockSpread has been engineered to exceed the 810G military drop test specification, and all of that protection comes in a lightweight and modular case design that you can customize to your liking. The bumper, rim and individual buttons can all be swapped out with other (optional) Mod NX or CrashGuard NX parts. With another Mod NX case, you can also swap out the backplates. Mix and match for a look that\'s all your own.\r\n</p><p><b>ShockSpread Material\r\n</b></p><p>The ShockSpread material of this case is 3mm thin, 1.1 oz light, and features a shock-absorbing honeycomb structure that lines the inner surface of the bumper. RhinoShield has engineered their ShockSpread material to absorb impacts of over 11\', exceeding the MIL-STD-810G US military drop test standard.\r\n</p><p><b>Additional Features\r\n</b></p><p>Formulated to meet US FDA food-grade standards\r\n</p><p>Contains no BPA, BPS, or BPF chemicals\r\n</p><p>Compatible with wireless charging\r\n</p><p>In the Box\r\n</p><p><ul><li>RhinoShield Mod NX iPhone Case \r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Bumper Frame\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Rim\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Backplate\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>3 x Buttons\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Limited Lifetime Warranty</li></ul></p><p>\r\n</p><p> \r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p> \r\n</p><p> \r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:18','2026-07-18 07:18:18'),(300,300,'OnePlus Nord 2 5G 12 GB RAM + 256 GB Storage Gray Sierra','pc','<p>• 50 MP AI triple camera\r\n</p><p>• Warp Charge 65 + 4500mAh battery\r\n</p><p>• 90 Hz fluid AMOLED display\r\n</p><p>• MediaTek Dimensity 1200-AI chipset</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:18','2026-07-18 07:18:18'),(301,301,'ITSKINS HYBRID SPARK For iPhone 12 Pro Max','PC','<p><ul><li>3m/10 ft Drop certified\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Raised Corners\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Ultra Soft and flex\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Engineered Shock Absorbing Design\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Antimicrobial Defence</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:19','2026-07-18 07:18:19'),(302,302,'JCPAL DuraPro Protective Folio Case for iPad 10.2\"','pc','<p>The slim and lightweight DuraPro Protective Folio Case provides elegant protection for your iPad. Featuring a folding stand cover that supports multiple viewing angles, and a flexible and highly protective silicone shell with a compartment for your Apple Pencil, the case provides complete protection without restricting access to the iPads buttons or functions.\r\n</p><p><ul><li>Built-in Apple Pencil holder\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Compatible with Pencil charge/sync\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Multi-angle adjustable stand\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Water resistant cover supports iPad auto-wake/sleep functionality\r\n</li></ul></p><ul><li>Shock absorbing frame offers 360° protection\r\n</li></ul><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:19','2026-07-18 07:18:19'),(303,303,'OnePlus Nord 2 5G 8 GB RAM + 128 GB Storage','pc','<p><ul><li>&nbsp;50 MP AI triple camera\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>&nbsp;Warp Charge 65 + 4500mAh battery\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>&nbsp;90 Hz fluid AMOLED display\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>&nbsp;MediaTek Dimensity 1200-AI chipset</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:19','2026-07-18 07:18:19'),(304,304,'OnePlus 8T 8GB RAM + 128GB Storage','pc','<p><ul><li>OnePlus 8T 5G\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Ultra Fast Charging. Wrap Charging 65\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Ultra Smooth Scrolling.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>48MP Quad Camera</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:19','2026-07-18 07:18:19'),(305,305,'OnePlus 8T 12GB RAM + 256GB Storage','pc','<h6>Product details of OnePlus 8T 12GB RAM + 256GB Storage</h6><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><p></p><ul><li>Network Technology: GSM / CDMA / HSPA / LTE / 5G, Dual SIM (Nano-SIM, dual stand-by)</li></ul><ul><li>Body Dimension: 160.7 x 74.1 x 8.4 mm (6.33 x 2.92 x 0.33 in), Weight: 188 g (6.63 oz), Build: Glass front (Gorilla Glass 5), glass back (Gorilla Glass 5), aluminum frame</li></ul><ul><li>Display: 6.55 inches, Fluid AMOLED, 120Hz, HDR10+, 1080 x 2400 pixels, 20:9 ratio (~402 ppi density)</li></ul><ul><li>Chipset: Qualcomm SM8250 Snapdragon 865 (7 nm+), Octa-core (1x2.84 GHz Kryo 585 &amp; 3x2.42 GHz Kryo 585 &amp; 4x1.8 GHz Kryo 585), GPU: Adreno 650</li></ul><ul><li>RAM: 12GB, Storage: 256 GB, OS: Android 11, OxygenOS 11.0.4</li></ul><p></p></td><td><p></p><ul><li>Front Camera: 16 MP, f/2.4, (wide), Rearcamera: 48 MP, f/1.7, 26mm (wide), 16 MP, f/2.2, 14mm, 123˚ (ultrawide), 5 MP, f/2.4, (macro), 2 MP,</li></ul><p></p><ul><li>f/2.4, (depth), Video: 4K@30/60fps, 1080p@30/60/240fps, Auto HDR, gyro-EIS</li><li>Sound: Dual Stereo Speakers, Noise cancellation support, Dolby Atmos®\"</li><li>Connectivity, Wi-Fi 802.11 a/b/g/n/ac/6, dual-band, Wi-Fi Direct, DLNA, hotspot, Bluetooth 5.1, USB Type-C 3.1, USB On-The-Go</li><li>Sensors: \"In-display Fingerprint Sensor, Accelerometer, Electronic Compass, Gyroscope, Ambient Light Sensor, Proximity Sensor, Sensor</li><li>Core, Flicker-detect Sensor, \" dual-band A-GPS, GLONASS, BDS, GALILEO, SBAS</li><li>Battery: Li-Po 4500 mAh, Fast charging 65W, 100% in 39 min (advertised)</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:19','2026-07-18 07:18:19'),(306,306,'ITSKINS SUPREME For iPhone 12 Pro MAX','PC','<p>Clear but hard. Like our future. Get some protection. Set out prepared for the best with our Ballistic hardback case. HEXO-TEK™ PRO 2.0 delivers military-grade 3 meters / 10 Feet Drop Protection with our innovative AirPocket tech embodied in Dupont Impact Gel. Protection that is clearly the best.\r\n</p><p>SUPREME CLEAR offers the latest innovation in extreme drop protection. Showcasing 4 layers protection; including an integrated Air Mattress, a frost finish for ultimate grip, Dupont ULTRA ABSORBENT Polymer, and the ITSKINS signature HEXO-TEK™ PRO 2.0 technology.</p><p><ul><li>Antimicrobial defence\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Slimmest of the category\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>4.5m/15 ft Drop certified\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Raised Corners Plus\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Ultra Soft and flex\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>4 Layer Shock Absorbing Design</li></ul></p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:19','2026-07-18 07:18:19'),(307,307,'JCPAL iClara Glass Screen Protector for iPad 10.2\"','pc','<p>iClara Classic glass screen protector is made with tempered glass that maintains perfect clarity while providing an incredible 9H level scratch protection, effectively preventing scratches from keys, sand and other hard objects. The ultra-thin glass also features an anti-glare and anti-fingerprint treatment, keeping your screen clean and easy to see in brightly lit environments.\r\n</p><p><ul><li>Incredible 9H level scratch protection\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Features curved 2.5D edge\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Ultra-thin and tough\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Easy to install and remove\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Fingerprint resistant\r\n</li></ul></p><ul><li>Anti-glare treatment\r\n</li></ul><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:19','2026-07-18 07:18:19'),(308,308,'RhinoShield SolidSuit Case for iPhone 12 Pro MAX','PC','<p><ul><li>Scratch and Shock Resistant\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Protects from Impacts of up to 11\'\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Meets MIL-STD-810G Military Standard\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Side Coverage with Built-In Buttons\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Precision Cutouts for Port Access\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Raised Lip for Screen Impact Protection\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Compatible with Qi Wireless Chargers\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>100% Recyclable\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>BPA, BPS, and BPF Free + Food Grade</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:19','2026-07-18 07:18:19'),(309,309,'ITSKINS FERONIABIO TIMBER For iPhone 12 Pro Max','PC','<p>At ITSKINS we believe that every product needs a second life, or even a third or fourth. At ITSKINS we are striving to reuse reclaimed materials and put in place  full-circle production. FERONIABIO TIMBER blends our advanced BIO Polymer, reclaimed metal (to make this cover compatible with magnetic mounts and wireless chargers) and high-quality wood offcuts from  premium furniture producers. FERONIABIO TIMBER is designed around our world recognized HEXOTEK XTRA technology, the most efficient shock absorbing technology available in smartphone cases. It has been certified to protect your device from drops up to 2m /7 Ft. This 100% ECO Conscious cover will not only enhance the beauty of your phone with the natural grain of the wooden back but also protect it against high impact drops.</p><p>Slim and Protective\r\n</p><p><ul><li>Biodegradable\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>2m/7 ft Drop certified\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Raised Corners\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Engineered Shock Absorbing Design\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Antimicrobial Defence</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:19','2026-07-18 07:18:19'),(310,310,'Moshi VersaCover Case with Folding Cover for iPad 10.2\"','pc','<p><ul><li>Unique origami folding cover doubles as a stand\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>3 viewing options to place your iPad at all the right angles for typing, reading, and browsing the web\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Water-resistant microfiber-lined front cover can avoid stains, also it can to cushion and protect your touchscreen\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Magnetic flap keeps the cover closed and secure, while also protecting your Apple Pencil\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Supports auto-wake/sleep\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Easy access to all iPad buttons and cameras\r\n</li></ul></p><ul><li>360-degree protection to shield your touchscreen while a shock-absorbing frame protects your device from scratches and shocks\r\n</li></ul><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:19','2026-07-18 07:18:19'),(311,311,'Moshi VersaCover Case with Folding Cover for iPad 10.2\"','pc','<p><ul><li>Unique origami folding cover doubles as a stand\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>3 viewing options to place your iPad at all the right angles for typing, reading, and browsing the web\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Water-resistant microfiber-lined front cover can avoid stains, also it can to cushion and protect your touchscreen\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Magnetic flap keeps the cover closed and secure, while also protecting your Apple Pencil\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Supports auto-wake/sleep\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Easy access to all iPad buttons and cameras\r\n</li></ul></p><ul><li>360-degree protection to shield your touchscreen while a shock-absorbing frame protects your device from scratches and shocks\r\n</li></ul><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:19','2026-07-18 07:18:19'),(312,312,'Moshi iGlaze Slim Hardshell Case For iPhone 12 Pro MAX','PC','<p><b>iGlaze Slim Hardshell Case\r\n</b></p><p>iGlaze is Moshi\'s signature slim hardshell case that offers the ultimate fusion of design, functionality, and drop protection. This shock-absorbing case features an embossed frame for improved grip when held in hand. Like all Moshi iPhone cases, iGlaze is 100% non-toxic and BPA-free. This case is compatible with our SnapTo magnetic mounting system.</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:19','2026-07-18 07:18:19'),(313,313,'Moshi Altra Slim Hardshell Case With Strap For iPhone 12 Pro MAX','PC','<p><b>Altra Slim Hardshell Case With Strap\r\n</b></p><p>This slim case features a detachable wrist strap to open a new world of hands-free convenience. A textured pattern improves grip on your phone. Like all Moshi iPhone cases, Altra is 100% non-toxic and BPA-free. This case is compatible with our SnapTo Series.\r\n</p><p><b>Carry on\r\n</b></p><p>No need to juggle your phone when you\'ve got your hands full; keep it within easy reach and protect against expensive drops. Moshi\'s exclusive quick-release ring design allows you to easily remove the wrist strap and place the phone flat on the table, upright on a wireless charging stand or in the pocket.\r\n</p><p><b>Stay germ-free\r\n</b></p><p>For added protection, Altra is treated with Moshi\'s proprietary NanoShield™ antimicrobial coating which kills germs and bacteria upon contact.\r\n</p><p><b>Add or remove in seconds\r\n</b></p><p>Altra\'s versatile wrist strap is secured with a quick-release buckle so you can change up your case to suit your style or your activity. Snap on the strap to keep a grip during your commute, then simply remove it and slide your phone into your pocket when it\'s time to hit the gym\r\n</p><p><b>Charge and mount with Altra\r\n</b></p><p>Altra is designed for Moshi\'s SnapTo™ magnetic mounting system. Remove the plastic tabs from your case and replace them with the metal tabs included with your SnapTo mount. Altra is compatible with Moshi\'s SnapTo magnetic mounting system for effortless one-handed mounting and supports wireless charging pass-through so you can charge your phone wirelessly without removing the case. Keep an eye on your notifications while fast-charging your device with Lounge Q - part of our stylish Q Wireless Charging Series.\r\n</p><p>Altra does not affect MagSafe wireless charging, but does NOT guarantee MagSafe will stick to your phone firmly with the case on.\r\n</p><p><b>Take hold with confidence\r\n</b></p><p>Altra\'s textured grip provides improved purchase while holding one-handed or taking photos, and soft-touch buttons provide easy access to key controls. Built to withstand the impact of daily life, Altra also provides military-grade drop protection, tested to ensure your phone can withstand drops from all angles (MIL-STD-810G, SGS-certified).</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:19','2026-07-18 07:18:19'),(314,314,'Moshi VersaCover Case with Folding Cover for iPad 10.2\"','pc','<p><ul><li>Unique origami folding cover doubles as a stand\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>3 viewing options to place your iPad at all the right angles for typing, reading, and browsing the web\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Water-resistant microfiber-lined front cover can avoid stains, also it can to cushion and protect your touchscreen\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Magnetic flap keeps the cover closed and secure, while also protecting your Apple Pencil\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Supports auto-wake/sleep\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Easy access to all iPad buttons and cameras\r\n</li></ul></p><ul><li>360-degree protection to shield your touchscreen while a shock-absorbing frame protects your device from scratches and shocks\r\n</li></ul><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:19','2026-07-18 07:18:19'),(315,315,'OnePlus 9 5G | 12GB RAM | 256GB Storage Black','pc','<p><b>Dimensions\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Height: 160 mm\r\n</li><li>Width: 74.2 mm\r\n</li><li>Thickness: 8.7 mm\r\n</li><li>Weight: 192g\r\n</li><li>Display\r\n</li></ul><p><b>Parameters\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Size: 6.55 inches (Measured diagonally from corner to corner.)\r\n</li><li>Resolution: 2400 x 1080 pixels 402 ppi\r\n</li><li>Aspect Ratio: 20:9\r\n</li><li>Type: 120 Hz Fluid AMOLED\r\n</li><li>Support sRGB, Display P3\r\n</li><li>Cover Glass: Corning® Gorilla® Glass\r\n</li></ul><p><b>Features\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Reading Mode\r\n</li><li>Night Mode\r\n</li><li>Vibrant Color Effect\r\n</li><li>Ultra-high Video Resolution\r\n</li><li>Performance\r\n</li><li>Operating System: OxygenOS based on Android™ 11\r\n</li><li>CPU: Qualcomm® Snapdragon™ 888\r\n</li><li>5G Chipset: X60\r\n</li><li>GPU: Adreno 660\r\n</li><li>RAM: 8GB/12GB LPDDR5\r\n</li><li>Storage: 128GB/256GB UFS 3.1 2-LANE\r\n</li><li>Battery: 4,500 mAh (2S1P 2,250 mAh, non-removable)\r\n</li><li>Warp Charge 65T (10V/6.5A)\r\n</li><li>15W Wireless Charging\r\n</li><li>Camera\r\n</li></ul><p><b>Main Camera\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Sensor: Sony IMX689\r\n</li><li>Sensor Size: 1/1.43\"\r\n</li><li>Megapixels: 48\r\n</li><li>Pixel Size: 1.12µm\r\n</li><li>Lens Quantity: 7P\r\n</li><li>Focal Length: 23mm equivalent\r\n</li><li>Aperture: ƒ/1.8\r\n</li></ul><p><b>Ultra-Wide Camera\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Sensor: Sony IMX766\r\n</li><li>Sensor Size: 1/1.56\"\r\n</li><li>Megapixels: 50\r\n</li><li>Lens Quantity: 7P\r\n</li><li>Focal Length: 14mm equivalent\r\n</li><li>Aperture: ƒ/2.2\r\n</li><li>Lens: Freeform Lens\r\n</li></ul><p><b>Monochrome Camera\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Megapixels: 2\r\n</li><li>Flash\r\n</li><li>Dual LED Flash\r\n</li></ul><p><b>Autofocus\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Multi Autofocus (All pixel omni-directional PDAF+CAF)\r\n</li></ul><p><b>Video\r\n</b></p><ul><li>8K video at 30 fps\r\n</li><li>4K video at 30/60 fps\r\n</li><li>1080p video at 30/60 fps\r\n</li><li>Super Slow Mot