ed look and feel of their iPhone. At just 0.35 mm thin, it is one of the slimmest cases in the world, offering superior scratch resistance from keys and other everyday items. SuperSkin’s extreme clarity allows the design of your phone to shine through, and a non-slip finish provides improved grip for added peace of mind. The case is easy to install, and features a raised camera cut out to protect your lens when laid flat. SuperSkin is available in Matte and Crystal Clear.\r\n</p><p><b>Product\r\n</b></p><p>SuperSkin Matte Clear Case for iPhone 11 Pro Max\r\n</p><p><b>P/N\r\n</b></p><p>99MO111933\r\n</p><p><b>Product Weight\r\n</b></p><p>0.21 oz (6 g)\r\n</p><p><b>Package Weight (include product)\r\n</b></p><p>1.76 oz (50 g)\r\n</p><p><b>Dimensions\r\n</b></p><p>6.22\" x 3.07\" x 0.33\" (15.8 x 7.8 x 0.85 cm)</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:19','2026-07-18 07:18:19'),(340,340,'Bella.de Jane.Stone Series Case for iPhoneX & XS Purple','pc','<p><ul><li>It is made of imported environmentally friendly TPU,\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>it can ease up the colision efficiently with its super toughness;\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Using the IMD technology and makes it durable and can keep its vivid color for long;\r\n</li></ul></p><ul><li>Creative marble design.\r\n</li></ul><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:19','2026-07-18 07:18:19'),(341,341,'RhinoShield Mod NX iPhone 11 Pro Case Black','PC','<p><ul><li>Modular and Customizable Design\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Constructed from ShockSpread Material\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Over 11\' of Drop Protection\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Shock Absorbing Honeycomb Interior\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>1.1 oz Lightweight Construction\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>3mm Thin for a Snug Fit\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Meets US FDA Food-Grade Standards\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>No BPA, BPS, or BPF Chemicals</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:19','2026-07-18 07:18:19'),(342,342,'Boya BY-WHM8 Pro Wireless Handheld Microphone','pc','<p></p><ul><li