, feel the action and never miss a beat with clear crisp JBL audio\r\n</p><p>Experience gaming like never before with different colour light presets and effect patterns, built into the Quantum Duo, set the mood and adjust the light type with the control button\r\n</p><p>Items delivered: 1 x JBL Quantum Duo gaming speakers, 2 USB powered PC gaming speakers, powerful sound, bold bass and cool lighting effects, take your gaming to the next level, plug and play speakers\r\n</p><ul><li>Package Dimensions	‎37.7 x 26.4 x 24.7 cm; 3.86 Kilograms\r\n</li><li>Item model number	‎JBLQUANTUMDUOBLKEU\r\n</li><li>Manufacturer	‎Harman\r\n</li><li>Series	‎JBLQUANTUMDUOBLKEU\r\n</li><li>Color	‎Black\r\n</li><li>Connectivity Type	‎Bluetooth\r\n</li><li>Power Source	‎Corded Electric\r\n</li><li>Hardware Platform	‎PC, Gaming Console\r\n</li><li>Are Batteries Included	‎No\r\n</li><li>Item Weight	‎3.86 kg</li></ul>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:19','2026-07-18 07:18:19'),(377,377,'G-Technology 4TB G-DRIVE mobile USB 3.1 Gen 2','PC','<p><ul><li>4TB Storage Capacity\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>USB 3.1 Gen 2 Type-C Interface\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Up to 140 MB/s Data Transfer Speed\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Bus Powered</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:19','2026-07-18 07:18:19'),(378,378,'G-Technology 2TB G-DRIVE mobile USB 3.1 Gen 2','PC','<p>Instructions File<br>\r\nExplaining what each of the installers are and step-by-step instructions on how to install the HFS+ driver for Windows by Paragon or G-Technology Format Wizard.<br>\r\nHFS+ Driver for Windows by Paragon Install<br>\r\nBy installing the HFS+ driver for Windows by Paragon on their Windows 10, 8.1 or 7 system, customers will be able to read/write to their G-Technology HFS+ formatted drive(s) from such PC, in addition to their Mac computer.<br>\r\nG-Technology Format Wizard<br>\r\nBy installing the G-Technology Format Wizard, users can reformat their G-Technology HFS+ formatted drive to NTFS to be used with Windows-only systems. Please be aware that reformatting the drive to NTFS will erase all current data on the drive and it will no longer be compatible with macOS. Please be sure to back up all data prior to performing this install.<br><ul><li>2TB Storage Capacity\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>USB 3.1 Gen 2 Type-C Interface\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Up to 140 MB/s Data Transfer Speed\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Bus Powered</li></ul></p><div>\r\n</div><div>\r\n</div>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:19','2026-07-18 07:18:19'),(379,379,'JBL Bar 5.1 Surround 550W Virtual 5.1-Channel Soundbar System','pc','<p><ul><li>Virtual 5.1-Channel Configuration\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Up to 550W of Total Power\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Built-In Wi-Fi &amp; Ethernet Connectivity\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>AirPlay 2 &amp; Chromecast built-in\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Bluetooth Audio Streaming\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>External Wireless Subwoofer\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>HDMI, Optical, USB Inputs\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>HDMI with ARC Out\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>MP3 &amp; WAV Playback via USB\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Includes Soundbar Wall Mounting Hardware</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:20','2026-07-18 07:18:20'),(380,380,'G-Technology 1TB G-DRIVE mobile USB 3.1 Gen 2','PC','<p><b>Instructions File\r\n</b></p><p>Explaining what each of the installers are and step-by-step instructions on how to install the HFS+ driver for Windows by Paragon or G-Technology Format Wizard.\r\n</p><p>HFS+ Driver for Windows by Paragon Install\r\n</p><p>By installing the HFS+ driver for Windows by Paragon on their Windows 10, 8.1 or 7 system, customers will be able to read/write to their G-Technology HFS+ formatted drive(s) from such PC, in addition to their Mac computer.\r\n</p><p>G-Technology Format Wizard\r\n</p><p>By installing the G-Technology Format Wizard, users can reformat their G-Technology HFS+ formatted drive to NTFS to be used with Windows-only systems. Please be aware that reformatting the drive to NTFS will erase all current data on the drive and it will no longer be compatible with macOS. 