SB 3.0 and SATA\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Water, Pressure, and Dust Resistant\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Case Interface: Thunderbolt 10 Gb/s\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Windows and Mac Compatible</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:20','2026-07-18 07:18:20'),(387,387,'JBL Bar 9.1 820W 5.1.4-Channel Soundbar System','pc','<p><ul><li>5.1.4-Channel Configuration</li></ul><ul><li>Up to 820W of Total Power</li></ul><ul><li>Bluetooth, AirPlay 2, and Chromecast</li></ul><ul><li>Rechargeable Wireless Surround Speakers</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:20','2026-07-18 07:18:20'),(388,388,'G-Technology G-DRIVE ev ATC | 1TB | 7200rpm | USB 3.0','PC','<p><ul><li>Hard Plastic\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Rugged, All-Terrain Drive Solution\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Shock Resistant up to 6.6\'\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Water, Pressure, and Dust Resistant\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Floats In Water\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>1TB Capacity</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:20','2026-07-18 07:18:20'),(389,389,'j5create JEE251 2.5\" SATA to USB 3.0 External Hard Drive Enclosure','PC','<p><ul><li>USB 3.0 SuperSpeed 5Gbps, 10 times faster transfer rate, backwards compatible with\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>USB1.1, USB 2.0 specifications.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>The shock proof rubber casing prevents vibration\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Hot-Swappable Plug &amp; Play without rebooting\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Blue LED indicates power &amp; HDD activity</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:20','2026-07-18 07:18:20'),(390,390,'Satechi Universal Vertical Laptop Aluminum Stand','pc','<p><ul><li>CREATES MORE SPACE\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>STURDY ALUMINUM BODY\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>PROMOTES AIR FLOW\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>UNIVERSAL COMPATIBILITY</li></ul></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:20','2026-07-18 07:18:20'),(391,391,'G-Technology G-Drive Mobile SSD 1TB USB Type-C Rugged','pc','<p><ul><li>1TB Storage Capacity\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>USB 3.1 Gen 2 Type-C Interface\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Up to 560 MB/s Data Transfer Speed\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Bus Powered</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:20','2026-07-18 07:18:20'),(392,392,'j5create JUD650 Android Dock','pc','<p>The j5create Android Dock is a unique mobile accessory that allows ultimate Android control. The Android Dock is designed with an adjustable angle for easier reading and browsing on your Android device and allows for USB connectivity to increase your efficiency by utilizing a keyboard and mouse to navigate and type.</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:20','2026-07-18 07:18:20'),(393,393,'G-Technology G-Drive Mobile SSD 500GB USB Type-C Rugged','pc','<p><ul><li>500GB Storage Capacity\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>USB 3.1 Gen 2 Type-C Interface\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Up to 560 MB/s Data Transfer Speed\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Bus Powered</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:20','2026-07-18 07:18:20'),(394,394,'KEF E305 Home Theater System','PC','<p><b>Extermely Accurate\r\n</b></p><p>A perfectly balanced, seamlessly integrated high end 5.1 sub/sat system based on KEF’s new 4.25” Uni-Q driver array and a superlative matching subwoofer, the new E305 home theatre system outperforms the competition by filling the room with a spacious, exquisitely detailed and compellingly natural soundscape that captures all the magic of the original performance.\r\n</p><p><b>4.25in Uni-Q Driver Array\r\n</b></p><p>The secret of the E305 system’s outstanding hi-fi response lies in the latest iteration of KEF\'s signature Uni-Q driver array, originally developed for the multiple award-winning Q Series. With its famously wide dispersion characteristics and sonic purity, this technology is what gives the system its extraordinarily natural sound quality.\r\n</p><p><b>Uni-Q Tweeter\r\n</b></p><p>The tweeter at the centre of the midrange cone is vented to prevent distortion-inducing high pressure from building up behind the dome, so the response in the critical vocal region remains intricately detailed with every nuance of the original recording. With KEF’s ‘tangerine’ waveguide, it encourages the sound to radiate evenly, increasing both the dispersion and sensitivity of the tweeter for a more natural performance throughout the listening area.\r\n</p><p><b>Uni-Q MF/LF Driver\r\n</b></p><p>Being stiffer than conventional materials, the aluminium midrange cone operates rigidly over the entire vocal range for the smooth, clear midrange response that reproduces the human voice with stunning accuracy.  Together with KEF’s Z-flex cone surround it allows the cone full excursion while providing a smooth, uninterrupted surface over which the tweeter output passes with no disturbance or diffraction effects. Its undercut magnet designed driver motor, which usually is only found in high end speakers, reduces midrange distortion by generating a very symmetrical magnetic field, resulting transparency helps to create the feeling of ‘being there’.\r\n</p><p>E305\r\n</p><p>Enjoy the extreme pleasures of experiencing true hi-fi sound quality from your music and movies with our new E Series home theatre speaker system.\r\n</p><p>Model	E301/ E301c\r\n</p><p>Design	Two-way bass reflex\r\n</p><p>Drive units	Uni-Q driver array:\r\n</p><p>HF: 19mm (0.75in.) vented aluminium dome\r\n</p><p>MF: 115mm (4.25in.) aluminium\r\n</p><p>Frequency range (-6dB)	80Hz – 45kHz\r\n</p><p>Frequency response (±3dB)	90Hz - 33kHz\r\n</p><p>Crossover frequency	2.7kHz\r\n</p><p>Amplifier requirements	10 - 100W\r\n</p><p>Sensitivity (2.83V/ 1m)	86dB\r\n</p><p>Harmonic distortion\r\n</p><p>2nd &amp; 3rd harmonics (90dB, 1m)	&lt;1% 100Hz – 40kHz\r\n</p><p>Maximum output (SPL)	109dB\r\n</p><p>Norminal impedance	8Ω (min. 3.4 Ω)\r\n</p><p>Internal volume	1.5Litres\r\n</p><p>Weight	2.4kg (5.3 lbs.)\r\n</p><p>Dimensions\r\n</p><p>(H x W x D)\r\n</p><p>(with grille and base) \r\n</p><p>E301 \r\n</p><p>E301c	\r\n</p><p>260 x 136 x 159 mm (10.2 x 5.4 x 6.3 in.)\r\n</p><p>157 x 220 x 155 mm (6.2 x 8.7 x 6.1 in.)\r\n</p><p>Optional accessories	Floor stands\r\n</p><p>Model	E-2\r\n</p><p>Design	Powered Subwoofer\r\n</p><p>LF Drive unit	200mm (8in.)\r\n</p><p>Frequency range (-6dB)	33Hz – 280Hz\r\n</p><p>Amplifier	250W built-in Class-D\r\n</p><p>Maximum output (SPL)	102dB\r\n</p><p>Low pass filter variable	Fixed 250Hz, 2nd-order\r\n</p><p>Low level signal inputs	RCA phono socket\r\n</p><p>Enclosure type	Sealed\r\n</p><p>Internal volume	14.7Litres\r\n</p><p>Power requirements	100 - 240VAC 50/60Hz\r\n</p><p>Power consumption	250VA\r\n</p><p>Weight	7.25kg (16lbs.)\r\n</p><p>Dimensions\r\n</p><p>(H x W x D)	320 x 430 x 270mm (12.6 x 16.9 x 10.6 in.)</p><p> \r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:20','2026-07-18 07:18:20'),(395,395,'APPLE USB SUPER DRIVE','pc','<p><ul><li>Apple USB SuperDrive If you want to burn discs or install the software you already own on discs, consider the external USB-based MacBook Air SuperDrive. It takes up very little space and easily connects to Mac mini with a single USB cable there’s no separate power adapter.</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:20','2026-07-18 07:18:20'),(396,396,'KEF KEF Ci160.2CR 5.1 In Ceiling Package','PC','<p>This package includes five Ci160.2CR speakers for front and rear installation along with a T2 subwoofer in a choice of finishes. This entry level set up creates a great home cinema sound experience.</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:20','2026-07-18 07:18:20'),(397,397,'Kodak 960GB X150 SATA III 2.5\" Internal SSD','pc','<p><b>Storage\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Drive Capacity	960.00 GB\r\n</li></ul><p><b>Performance\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Interface	SATA III (6 Gb/s)\r\n</li><li>Maximum Read Speed	520 MB/s\r\n</li><li>Maximum Write Speed	500 MB/s\r\n</li><li>Physical\r\n</li><li>Drive Type	SSD\r\n</li><li>Form Factor	2.5\" (7 mm)\r\n</li></ul><p><b>SSD Specs\r\n</b></p><ul><li>SMART Support	Yes\r\n</li><li>TRIM Support	Yes\r\n</li></ul><p><b>Reliability / Data Integrity\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Mean Time Between Failures (MTBF)	2.0 Million Hours\r\n</li></ul><p><b>General\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Dimensions (W x H x D)	2.75 x 0.28 x 3.94\" / 69.85 x 7 x 100 mm\r\n</li></ul><p><b>Packaging Info\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Package Weight	0.115 lb\r\n</li><li>Box Dimensions (LxWxH)	7 x 5 x 0.3\"\r\n</li></ul><p><b>In the Box\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Kodak 960GB X150 SATA III 2.5\" Internal SSD</li></ul>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:20','2026-07-18 07:18:20'),(398,398,'KEF Q350 5.1 Speaker Package','PC','<p>KEF Q350 5.1 Speaker Package is a high-performing package that has been carefully curated to celebrate KEF\'s new and updated Q-Series range. The package consists of a pair of Q350 speakers for front channels, a pair of Q350 speakers for rear channels, a Q650C centre speaker and a Kube 12 subwoofer.\r\n</p><p><b>KEF Q350 Speaker\r\n</b></p><p>An update of the Q300, the Q350 showcases an enhanced Uni-Q driver with a new central position that reduces resonances for an intricately detailed sound performance. The Q350 is the older brother of the Q150, offering a larger construction and more expressive sound quality than its diminutive fellow bookshelf speaker.\r\n</p><p>This model has been selected to broadcast the front channels of the system.\r\n</p><p><b>KEF Q650C Centre Speaker\r\n</b></p><p>This centre speaker is the must-have accompianment to the speakers in the brand\'s updated Q-Series. This model truly enhances your home entertainment system thanks to its  UNi-Q driver array and a closed box cabinet.\r\n</p><p>For more information on this model, including full technical specifications, visit our main KEF Q650C product page.\r\n</p><p><b>KEF Kube 12 KHT Subwoofer\r\n</b></p><p>This active  powerful finishing touch to this high-performing speaker package. Its in-built Class D amplifier has the flexibility to match your sound requirements, so you can mold its performance to your room-specific needs.</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:20','2026-07-18 07:18:20'),(399,399,'Kodak 240GB X150 SATA III 2.5\" Internal SSD','pc','<p><b>Storage\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Drive Capacity	240.00 GB\r\n</li></ul><p><b>Performance\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Interface	SATA III (6 Gb/s)\r\n</li><li>Maximum Read Speed	520 MB/s\r\n</li><li>Maximum Write Speed	500 MB/s\r\n</li></ul><p><b>Physical\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Drive Type	SSD\r\n</li><li>Form Factor	2.5\" (7 mm)\r\n</li></ul><p><b>SSD Specs\r\n</b></p><ul><li>SMART Support	Yes\r\n</li><li>TRIM Support	Yes\r\n</li><li>Reliability / Data Integrity\r\n</li><li>Mean Time Between Failures (MTBF)	2.0 Million Hours\r\n</li></ul><p><b>General\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Dimensions (W x H x D)	2.75 x 0.28 x 3.94\" / 69.85 x 7 x 100 mm\r\n</li></ul><p><b>Packaging Info\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Package Weight	0.115 lb\r\n</li><li>Box Dimensions (LxWxH)	7 x 5 x 0.3\"\r\n</li></ul><p><b>In the Box\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Kodak 240GB X150 SATA III 2.5\" Internal SSD</li></ul>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:20','2026-07-18 07:18:20'),(400,400,'KEF LS50 5.1 Speaker Package Black','PC','<p>This cost effective and practical KEF 5.1 package includes 5 LS50 speakers in black; a pair for the fronts, a pair for the rears and one for centre along with a Kube 12 subwoofer.</p><p>KEF LS50 Speaker\r\n</p><p>One of the best loudspeakers released in recent years, the KEF LS50 has won virtually every award possible including the What Hi-Fi \'Readers Award\' in 2013 and 2014, \'Best Standmounter\' of its price range in 2012 and 2013 and \'Product of the Year\' 2012. KEF LS50 50th Anniversary speakers are innovative and professional designed to bring recording studio quality to your home in even the smallest of spaces. Rarely found in such a compact design, the LS50s deliver a rich, multi dimensional soundstage experience, filling the room with equisite sound far beyond the conventional performance of similar sized speakers.\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>KEF LS50\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 