><li>Charging cable sold separately.</li></ul></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:26','2026-07-18 07:18:26'),(919,919,'Amazfit GTS 3 Black','Pcs','<p><ul><li>Ultra HD AMOLED Display \r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Easy 24H Health Management \r\n</li></ul><ul><li>150+ Sport Modes \r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Powerful Zepp OS\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Alexa Built-in\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Classic Navigation Crown\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>12-day Battery Life</li></ul></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:26','2026-07-18 07:18:26'),(920,920,'Amazfit Neo Smart Watch','Pcs','<p><ul><li>Call Reminders, Alarm Clock, Sedentary Reminders, etc.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Continuous Heart Rate &amp; Sleep Monitoring: Amazfit Neo Smartwatch for Android/IOS can track your heart rate 24/7. Also can monitor your sleep. Once synchronized to the app, you can review the various stages and quality of your sleep.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>1.2â Always-on Display with Retro Design and Lift-to-wake Backlight: Amazfit Neo Smart Watch features a retro styled, always-on display. Itâs power efficient and lets you see the screen clearly under bright light. The Lift-to-wake feature allows you to activate the screen quickly and naturally when reading the time\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Message and Phone Call Notification: Amazfit Neo Smartwatch for Men and Women can sync with text messages, e-mails and notifications from a number of popular apps on your smartphone\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>5 ATM Water Resistance &amp; Tracking of 3 Sports Modes: Amazfit Neo Smartwatch Sport It features a durable exterior case and PUR strap that provides effective waterproofing to a depth of 50 meters. Running, walking or cycling, the resilient design will perform in the tough environments</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:26','2026-07-18 07:18:26'),(921,921,'Amazfit GTR 3 Black','Pcs','<p><ul><li>21-day Battery Life\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Easy 24 Health Management\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Powerful Zepp OS\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Alexa Built-in\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Classic Navigation Crown\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>150+ Sport Modes</li></ul></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:26','2026-07-18 07:18:26'),(922,922,'Anker PowerWave | Stand','Pc','<ul><li>Anker — the Choice of 20 Million+ Happy Users\r\n</li><li>18 months warranty\r\n</li><li>Delivers up to 10W of power\r\n</li><li>Secure non-slip device base\r\n</li><li>Case-friendly construction\r\n</li><li>Multi-protect technology\r\n</li><li>Compatible with most cell phones with or without case.</li></ul>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:26','2026-07-18 07:18:26'),(923,923,'Powercore 10000Mah','Pc','<p><ul><li>The Anker Advantage: Join the 30 million+ powered by our leading technology.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Remarkably Compact: One of the smallest (2.4 x 3.6 x 0.9 inch) and lightest (6.4 oz)10, 000mAh portable chargers. Provides almost three-and-a-half iPhone 8 charges or two-and-a-half Galaxy S8 charges.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>High-Speed Charging: Anker’s exclusive PowerIQ and VoltageBoost combine to deliver the fastest possible charge for any device. Qualcomm Quick Charge not supported.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Certified Safe: Anker’s MultiProtect safety system ensures complete protection for you and your devices.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>What You Get: Anker PowerCore 10000 portable charger, Micro USB cable, travel pouch, welcome guide, our worry-free 18-month warranty and friendly customer service. USB-C and Lightning cable for iPhone / iPad sold separately.</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:26','2026-07-18 07:18:26'),(924,924,'AQFIT W9 SmartWatch','Pc','<p><ul><li>DESIGN: Carry your style with beautiful 3D curved screen sculpted in Zinc- Magnesium Alloy body for a smoother touch &amp; vividly detailed display. The 1.33 inch HD IPS display with 240 x 240 resolution will make using your watch an experience you always desired. Match your everyday look with its multiple watch faces options.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>BLUETOOTH CALLING: BT 5.0 syncs your watch to your phone instantly with inbuilt speaker and microphone, enabling calling capabilities right from your wrist. Get your favourite contacts &amp; call records on the watch and even answer calls without picking up the phone\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Splash proof: Don\'t worry about sweat or water splashes with water resistant and dustproof built with IP67 certification. Now take your watch to all your daily workout sessions in all weather conditions\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>MULTI SPORTS MODES: The W9 is made to monitor most of your important sporting activities with different modes to select. It reads different signals depending on the activity and delivers highly accurate readings and performance results to help you improve.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>LASTS LONG: A strong 280mAh battery along with a high end super fast chipset to keep your watch powered up for up to 7-10 days on regular use, 30 days on stand-by and up to 2 days* BT calling on a single charge.</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:26','2026-07-18 07:18:26'),(925,925,'AQFIT W15 SmartWatch','Pc','<p><ul><li>Battery Capacity: 220mAh, 8-10days Regular Use &amp; Up to 60 days Stand by time in a single charge\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>App: YFit\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Heart Rate Monitoring, Blood Oxygen (SPO2) Monitor, Sleep Monitor, Drink Water Reminder, Pedometer and Number of Calories Burnt, Multi Sport Modes, Smart Notification, Weather Notification\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>1.33Inch Full Touch HD IPS Color Display, 240 x 240 Pixel Resolution\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Smart Notification for Calls, Text message, Social Media notification\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Camera Control, Music Control, Weather Forecast, Anti Lost feature\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Waterproof level IP68\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Watch Face Customization\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Chip Set: Nordic NRF52832\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Bluetooth: Version 4.2\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Display Size: 1.4inch, 240X 240 pixel\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Display: IPS HD Full Touch Color Display\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Dial Shape: Circle\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>G-Sensor: ST LIS2DH12TR\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Battery Capacity:220mAh\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Battery Life (Regular use):8-10 days\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Battery Life(Stand by time): up to 60 days in a single charge\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Battery cell Composition: Lithium Polymer\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Compatible OS: Android 4.4/+, IOS 9.0/+\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Colors: Black, Green-Black, Grey-Black, Red-Black, Grey\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Connector Type: Wireless\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Strap Material: Silicone</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:26','2026-07-18 07:18:26'),(926,926,'AQFIT W14 SmartWatch','Pc','<p><ul><li>Supported Application CoolWear App\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Brand AQFIT\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Wireless Type Bluetooth\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Colour Black-Blue, Black-Red</li></ul><ul><li>Band Leather Black Brown</li></ul><ul><li>Connector Type Wireless\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>FULL TOUCH SCREEN DISPLAY: The 1.33 inches HD IPS round, full touch color display with a resolution of 240*240 makes it easy for you to scroll, see messages, notifications, track health and do other things on your watch. It brings you different visual experiences.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>IP68 WATERPROOF: AQFIT W14 comes with IP68, fully waterproof function, now swim, running in the rain or just jump into the water without any worries.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>MULTI-SPORTS MODES: Switch your AQFIT W14 Smart watch in 15 different sports modes and track all your activities whether it\'s running, walking, bike, treadmill, yoga, football, badminton, hike and what not in just one watch.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>HEALTH TRACKER: Built with latest Nordic chipset NFR52832 &amp; and supported with ST LIS2DH12TR sensor, AQFIT present W14 which features comprehensive activity and health tracking with a 24*7 Heart Rate Monitoring, Blood Oxygen (SPO2) Monitor, Sleep Monitor, Drink Water Reminder, Pedometer and Number of Calories Burnt.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>DESIGN: Slim and sleek, Zinc-Magnesium Alloy body, comfortable food-grade silicone strap, artistic design, carbon fiber back case, unibody design and large screen display makes it the best and the most worthy Smart watch in the market.</li></ul></p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:26','2026-07-18 07:18:26'),(927,927,'AQFIT W12 SmartWatch','Pc','<p><ul><li>Bluetooth 5.0\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>1.69 inch Touch Display\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Water Resistant, IP68\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Dust Proof\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Heart Rate Monitor\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>SpO2 (Blood Oxygen) Monitor\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Pedometer, Sleep Monitor, Calorie Count, Step Count\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>10 days Battery</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:26','2026-07-18 07:18:26'),(928,928,'AQFIT W5 SmartWatch','Pc','<p><ul><li>Screen 1.54 inch larger color screen, you can see more clearly\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Waterproof IP67 deep waterproof, no fear of sweat, rain, the most reassuring sport\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Heart Rate Monitor Support\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Blood Pressure Monitor Support\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Blood Oxygen Monitor Support\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Sedentary reminders Support\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Sleep Monitor Support\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Multi-sport Modality Support (Running and Jogging, Horse riding, Mountaineering),Call or Reminder, Message, Rejecting a Call\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Notification Support Facebook, Twitter, Wechat, WhatsApp etc. Type of alarm: Vibration, Auto Light-up Screen, Stopwatch\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Other Functions Support Pedometer, Alarm, Calendar, Sedentary Reminder, Remote Control Camera, Anti-lost, weather forecast\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>App Language English, Portuguese, Spanish, French</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:26','2026-07-18 07:18:26'),(929,929,'AQFIT W11 SmartWatch','Pc','<p><ul><li>DESIGN: Give your style a boost with the 4.0D curved screen crafted in an ultra thin Zinc-Magnesium Alloy case with a segment redefining screen-to-body ratio of 93%. The 1.4 inch Super Retina display in 320*320 resolution is able to adapt to your surroundings delivering natural colors which look as sharp whether you are in dark or out in bright sunlight.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>FUNCTIONALITY: Keep your hands free from your phone by completing most of your tasks from your wrist. Control music, Control camera, get weather reports, read messages and notifications. Even helps you find your phone when you have misplaced it in the room.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>WATERPROOF: Take you watch where you go, even for a swim. With IP68 certification for upto 5ATM, keep your watch on to track your swims with utmost accuracy and not worry about sweat or splashes damaging your watch.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>15 SPORTS MODES: AQFIT takes your sports seriously. We know how each activity has different movements. Our 15 activity modes read different signals depending on the activity and deliver highly accurate readings and performance results as appropriate for that particular activity. Whether it\'s running, walking, hiking, biking, yoga, swimming or just outdoor sports like football &amp; badminton, W11 has you covered.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>NON STOP PERFORMANCE: At the heart of the W11 is the performance oriented latest Nordic chipset NFR52832 supported with ST LIS2DH12TR sensor. Known for delivering 40% higher efficiencies consuming 50% less power, it is part of the reason how the battery is able to pack so much power in such a slim design. With 8-10 days under regular usage and a staggering 60 days of stand by time in a single charge.</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:26','2026-07-18 07:18:26'),(930,930,'Remax TWS-23 earbuds','Pc','<p><ul><li>Auto-Pair upon Taking Out\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Bluetooth Version: 5.0\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Magnetic Earbuds, Easy and Safe Storage\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Music Continuously for about 3-3.5 Hrs.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>One-Handed Operation, Portable to carry\r\n</li></ul><