orama, HDR\r\n</p><p>Video:4K@30fps, 1080p@30/60fps; gyro-EIS\r\n</p><p>Front Selfie Camera (Single):32 MP, f/2.2, 26mm (wide), 1/2.8\", 0.8µm+HDR\r\n</p><p>Video:4K@30fps, 1080p@30fps\r\n</p><p>Loudspeaker: Yes, with stereo speakers\r\n</p><p>Audio: 3.5mm Jack: Yes\r\n</p><p>Wlan: Wi-Fi 802.11 a/b/g/n/ac/6, dual-band, Wi-Fi Direct, hotspot\r\n</p><p>Bluetooth:5.0, A2DP, LE\r\n</p><p>GPS: Yes, with A-GPS, GLONASS, GALILEO, BDS, QZSS\r\n</p><p>NFC: Yes (market/region dependent)\r\n</p><p>Radio: Unspecified\r\n</p><p>USB:USB Type-C 2.0, USB On-The-Go\r\n</p><p>Sensor: Fingerprint (under display, optical), accelerometer, gyro, proximity, compass\r\n</p><p>Battery: Li-Po 4500 mAh, non-removable\r\n</p><p>Charging: Fast charging 25W, 50% in 30 min (advertised)\r\n</p><p>Wireless: No\r\n</p><p>Color Option: Awesome Black</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:26','2026-07-18 07:18:26'),(933,933,'Samsung Galaxy A525F 8 GB RAM | 128 GB Storage','Pc','<p>Display Size- 6.5 mm</p><p> IP67 dust/water resistant (up to 1m for 30 mins)</p><p>Processer- Qualcomm SM7125 Snapdragon 720G (8 nm)</p><p>Memory- 8 GB RAM and 128 GB ROM</p><p>Camera- 64+12+5+5 main camera and 32 MP selfie camera</p><p>Battery- 4500 mAh</p><p>Security- On screen finger print</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:26','2026-07-18 07:18:26'),(934,934,'SAMSUNG AC 0.75 TON INVERTER | AR09MSFHRWKNRC','Pc','<p><ul><li>Brand Name: SAMSUNG\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Model No:AR09MSFHRWKNRC\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Type: Air Conditioner (Split Type)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Capacity: 0.75 Tons\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Cooling Capacity: 8,530 Btu/hr\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Heating Capacity: 11,260 Btu/hr\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Power Consumption: Cooling: 670 W, Heating: 910 W\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>1 Year Manufacturer &amp; 10 Years Compressor Warranty</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:26','2026-07-18 07:18:26'),(935,935,'SAMSUNG AC INVERTER 1 TON | AR12TSHZRWKXRC','Pc','<p><ul><li>Color White </li></ul><ul><li>Type Split </li></ul><ul><li>AC Capacity(Tons) 1 </li></ul><ul><li>Functions Cooling &amp; Heating </li></ul><ul><li>Cooling Capacity 11,942 Btu/hr </li></ul><ul><li>Heating Capacity 13,648 Btu/hr </li></ul><ul><li>Compressor Digital Inverter Compressor </li></ul><ul><li>Dehumidification No Remote </li></ul><ul><li>Control Yes </li></ul><ul><li>Product Dimensions Indoor: 826 x 275 x 260 mm, Outdoor: 720 x 265 x 548 mm</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:26','2026-07-18 07:18:26'),(936,936,'SAMSUNG AC INVERTER 1 TON | ARI2AXHZAWKNIM','Pc','<p>FEATURES\r\n</p><p>Both models boast 5 convertible modes: Party, Normal, Pleasant, Eco, and Home Alone, to deliver a different level of cooling. In Party mode, it consumes up to 120% power while that number goes down to 40% in Home mode.\r\n</p><p>For ensuring a healthy environment, these coolers have anti-dust and bacteria filters. It removes harmful irritants from the air and also improves cooling performance. Furthermore, thanks to the Digital Inverter Technology, it maintains the correct temperature without having to switch the compressors on/off frequently. Thus, it ensures less fluctuation and consumes less power.\r\n</p><p>COOLING\r\n</p><p>In terms of cooling, it offers 4-way and 2-way swing cooling. Under 4-way, the air flows left to right and up to down while the 2-way mode offers only up and down cooling. As a result, you get the flexibility to set it according to your need.\r\n</p><p>According to Samsung, these ACs cool the air 43% faster than conventional air coolers. In addition, it has a voltage fluctuation protector that prevents AC from sudden voltage surges.</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:26','2026-07-18 07:18:26'),(937,937,'SAMSUNG AC INVERTER 1.5 TON | AR19NSFHEWKNRC','Pc','<p>\r\n</p><p>GENERAL<ul><li>BRAND	Samsung\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>MODEL	AR19NSFHEWKNRC\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>COLOR	White\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>TYPE	Split AC\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>CAPACITY(TONS)	1.5\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>FUNCTIONS	Cooling &amp; Heating\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>COOLING CA