ort.\r\n</li></ul><p>Protection chip\r\n</p><ul><li>The RC-125a USB cable is built with a smart protection management system that adjusts the voltage to the needs of the equipment. So, your smartphone will only receive the amount of power it needs to recover as quickly as possible, with no risk of damaging the battery.\r\n</li></ul><p>Charge safely\r\n</p><ul><li>The Remax magnetic RC-125a technology uses a 2.4A current and a thick cable with thick res to ensure fast and reliable charging.\r\n</li></ul><p>Small and fashionable\r\n</p><ul><li>The Remax RC-125a magnetism is strong, and there are no knots. There\'s no need for a belt, and it stores in a moment. It has a beautiful appearance and a stylish personality.\r\n</li></ul><p>Compatible\r\n</p><ul><li>This Remax RC-125a is compatible with all the devices that come with type-C interfaces. Most of the devices are now available with C-type interfaces.</li></ul>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:28','2026-07-18 07:18:28'),(1019,1019,'REMAX | OTG MICRO-USB | RA-OTG','Pc','<p><ul><li>PRODUCT NAME: Remax micro usb otg adapter\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>CONNECTOR A: USB 2.0 female\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>CONNECTOR B: micro USB 2.0 5 pin\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>SIZE:20*15*6MM\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>COLOR: pink, gold\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>FUNCTION: Read exteral storage device\'s contents, connect mouse, keyboard to your phone, tablet.\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Compatible with Samsung, HTC, Sony, Huawei, Xiaomi and most android phones.</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:28','2026-07-18 07:18:28'),(1020,1020,'OnePlus 9 Pro 5G | 8 GB RAM | 256 GB','Pc','<p><ul><li>Network: Dual SIM (Nano-SIM, dual stand-by) GSM / CDMA / HSPA / LTE / 5G\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Body Dimension: 163.2 x 73.6 x 8.7 mm (6.43 x 2.90 x 0.34 in) Weight: 197 g\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Build: Glass front (Gorilla Glass 5), glass back (Gorilla Glass 5), aluminum frame\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Display: 6.7 inches, Fluid AMOLED, 120Hz, HDR10+, 1300 nits (peak), 1080 x 1440 x 3216 pixels, 20:9