, magnets, or cards are in the way of the charger and your phone.\r\n</li></ul><p>Safety\r\n</p><ul><li>This Remax RP-W14 wireless charger not only charges your phone but also protects it from overheating, overcharging, and short-circuiting while it charges. RP-W14 can also detect and alert you to the presence of foreign objects on the charger\'s surface, such as magnets.\r\n</li></ul><p>For AirPods\r\n</p><ul><li>Remax RP-W14 is compatible with AirPods (with wireless charging case) and AirPods Pro. The size of the AirPods fits perfectly into the charging area of the wireless charging pad, making it the ideal wireless charging companion for AirPods.</li></ul><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:28','2026-07-18 07:18:28'),(1029,1029,'REMAX | Alien pro  18W PD+ QC fast charging car charger | RCC214','PC','<p>An Ideal Combination\r\n</p><ul><li>The fast-charging Remax RCC-214 Car Charger has three USB ports and a micro USB charging cable. This RCC-214 USB ports charges at a maximum of 3.4 amps. You may now charge three gadgets at the same time.\r\n</li></ul><p>Safe &amp; Reliable\r\n</p><ul><li>Remax RCC-214 car chargers are safe and reliable in use. To protect the charging process, it has built-in fire, overheating, overcharging, and short-circuit protection.\r\n</li></ul><p>Lightweight Design\r\n</p><ul><li>The Remax RCC-214 car charger is compact in size. The RCC-214 charger is made of durable, and lightweight materials. So, you can have an exceptional and quick charging experience.\r\n</li></ul><p>Compatibility\r\n</p><ul><li>The Remax RCC-214 is compatible with devices that include smartphones, tablets, cameras, GPS units, Bluetooth headphones and speakers, smartwatches, and other USB-powered devices.\r\n</li></ul><p>Quick Charge\r\n</p><ul><li>You can charge your devices up to 20-30% faster than with a regular charger. Thanks to the Remax RCC-214 series of technologies that identify what power levels are required at any given time.\r\n</li></ul><p>Charging with high efficiency\r\n</p><ul><li>The Remax RC-214 USB car charger uses 3.4A max current technology. Up to 35W rapid charging, which is four times faster than standard charging. You need fast charging first and most, and your devices must be able to charge quickly.</li></ul><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:28','2026-07-18 07:18:28'),(1030,1030,'REMAX | 4-PORT WANFU USB Adapter | RP-U43 EU','PC','<p>Combination\r\n</p><ul><li>The fast charging of Remax 4-Port USB Adaptor charger has four USB ports. With these ports, you can charge at a maximum of 3.4 amps. Also, you can now charge four USB-type gadgets at the same time. Charge four smartphones at once with this REMAX USB charger, it quickly and readily identifies your devices. So, that maximize your time with the best charging efficiency.\r\n</li></ul><p>Safe &amp; Reliable\r\n</p><ul><li>To protect the charging process Remax RP-U43 EU, has built-in fire, overheating, overcharging, and short-circuit protection. RP-U43 EU allows you to charge your device unlimitedly without worrying about overheat or damaging your device.\r\n</li></ul><p>Lightweight Design\r\n</p><ul><li>The Remax RP-U43 EU 4 port USB charge is a compact, lightweight, sturdy materials-built charger that provides a superior and fast charge experience.\r\n</li></ul><p>Compatibility\r\n</p><ul><li>The Remax 4-Port USB Adaptor charger is all fully compatible with mobile telephones, tablets, Bluetooth headphones and ladders, smartwatches, and other USB-enabled devices.\r\n</li></ul><p>Charging with high efficiency\r\n</p><ul><li>The Remax RP-U43EU charger uses 3.4A max current technology. Fast USB charging output that allows high-speed charging to nearly any mobile device when charging multiple devices at the same time. RP-U43 EU has up to 25000 rapid working life, which is long-lasting than standard charging.\r\n</li></ul><p>Smart chip\r\n</p><ul><li>Remax RP-U43 EU 4 port USB is equipped with cutting-edge identification technology. As a result, the Remax RP-U43 EU USB adapts the required current to the connected device, resulting in improved current discharge.</li></ul><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:28','2026-07-18 07:18:28'),(1031,1031,'Samsung F42 5G | 6/8 GB RAM | 128GB ROM','PC','<p></p><ul><li>Display: 6.6-inches FHD+ TFT LCD Infinity-V panel\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Chipset: MediaTek Dimensity 700 5G (7nm)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Memory: 6/8 GB RAM, 128GB storage (expandable)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Rear Camera: Triple (64MP primary, 5MP ultra-wide, 2MP depth)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Front Camera: 8MP f/2.2 lens (notch)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Security: Side-mounted fingerprint scanner\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Audio: 3.5mm headphone jack, Dolby Atmos\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Battery: 5000mAh with 15W fast charging\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Colors: Blue</li></ul><p></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:28','2026-07-18 07:18:28'),(1032,1032,'Samsung M325F | 6GB RAM | 128GB ROM','PC','<p><ul><li>Display: 6.4-inches Super AMOLED, 90Hz refresh rate, 800 nits (peak) brightness\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Resolution: FHD+ (2400 x 1080 pixels), 20:9 aspect ratio, 411 PPI\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Chipset: MediaTek Helio G80 4G (12nm Mobile Platform)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Memory: 6GB LPDDR4X RAM, 128GB eMMC 5.1 storage (expandable)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Software &amp; UI: Android 11 with Samsung’s One UI Core 3.1 on top\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Rear Camera: Quad (64MP main, 8MP ultrawide, 2MP macro, 2MP portrait)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Front Camera: 20MP f/2.2 sensor (Infinity-U notch)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Security: Side-mounted fingerprint sensor, Face unlock, Samsung Knox\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Battery: 6000mAh with 25W fast charging (15W adapter inside the box)\r\n</li></ul><ul><li>Color Options: Light Blue, White</li></ul></p>','en','2026-07-18 07:18:28','2026-07-18 07:18:28'),(1033,1033,'REMAX | Elves Series sucked-type wireless