quire data of a general sort relating to excellence and social insurance subjects.\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The postings on the Site or a person to person communication locales, including the Site\'s Facebook page, or any data gave over talk or messages traded with Analogue Mall.com, its workers or delegates (on the whole alluded to as \"Data \") which are in promotion of any correspondence made by the client with Analogue Mall.com, its representatives or agents depends on the foundation given by the client. The Information isn\'t proposed to comprise individual clinical recommendation or be utilized for any clinical analysis or treatment.\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">While Analogue Mall.com takes sensible consideration to guarantee that the Information is precise, Analogue Mall.com makes no portrayal and assumes no liability for the exactness, culmination, suitability or value of the information. For particular ailments or issues, clients are encouraged to look for the sentiment from an affirmed clinical professional. In the occasion any client depends on the information given by Analogue Mall.com or its delegates/workers, he/she may do as such at its hazard. By no means will Analogue Mall.com, its workers, delegate or offshoots be at risk for the information or the outcomes of depending on such information.\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">With regards to Analogue Mall.com \'s goal of furnishing its clients with general data about magnificence and social insurance themes and items, Analogue Mall.com connects with specialists knowing about in their particular fields (\"Experts \") to react to questions posted by clients. Any data gave by the Experts, either over the Site, through messages, talk rooms or on long-range informal communication locales, including the Site\'s Facebook page depends on the Expert\'s genuine belief.\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Expert\'s Opinion isn\'t planned to comprise individual clinical proposal or be utilized for any clinical analysis or treatment. Analogue Mall.com makes no portrayal and assumes no liability for the precision, fulfilment, propriety or value of the Expert\'s Opinion. If any client depends on such Expert\'s Opinion, he/she may do as such at its hazard. By no means will the Analogue Mall.com, Company, its workers, delegate or members be subject for such Expert\'s Opinion or for the outcomes of depending on such Expert\'s Opinion.\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">For any broad data posted on the Site, clients must not expect that such data fundamentally concerns them.\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Assignment\r\n</b></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">These Terms, and any rights and licenses granted hereunder, may not be transferred or assigned by You but may be assigned by Analogue Mall.com without restriction. Any assignment or transfer by You shall be null and void. \r\n</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Governing Law and Disputes\r\n</b></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">These Terms shall be governed and construed following the laws of the Government of Nepal and shall have exclusive jurisdiction over all matters and disputes arising out of and relating to the business or Website.\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Indirect and Consequential Losses\r\n</b></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Save as expressly provided otherwise in this Agreement, neither party shall be liable under or in connection with this Agreement for any loss of income, loss of profits or loss of contracts, or for any indirect or consequential loss or damage of any kind, in each case howsoever arising and whether caused by tort (including negligence), breach of contract or otherwise.\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Equipment\r\n</b></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The User shall be responsible for obtaining and maintaining telephone, computer hardware and other equipment needed for access to and use of the Site and all charges related thereto. The Company shall not be liable for any damages to the User\'s equipment resulting from the use of the Site.\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Colors\r\n</b></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">While we have made every effort to display as accurately as possible the colours of the items that appear on the Site, we cannot guarantee that Your monitor or screen’s display of any colour will be completely accurate, as computer monitors and screens of electronic devices vary.\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Electronic Communications\r\n</b></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">When You use the Site or send emails or other data, information or communication to Us, You agree and understand that You are communicating with us through electronic records and You consent to receive communications via electronic records from Us periodically and as and when required. We will communicate with You by email or by an electronic record on Our Site which will be deemed adequate service of notice / electronic record.\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Chat Functionality\r\n</b></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Chat Functionality has been provided to help You with any Site-related queries. Any use of this service shall be subject to the following conditions:</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">1. Analogue Mall.com may suspend the chat service at any time without notice.\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">2. Analogue Mall.com or its executives are not responsible for any delay caused in attending to or replying to the queries via chat.\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">3. Communication through chat may be stored by Analogue Mall.com for future reference, and the User of such service will not have the right to access such information at any future date.\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">4. While \'chatting\' You may not communicate any objectionable information i.e. unlawful, threatening, abusive, defamatory, obscene information.\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">5. The chat room shall not be used to sell any products, to suggest a business opportunity or any other form of solicitation.\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">6. You may proceed further and chat with Our online customer care executive only if You agree to the above terms and conditions.</p><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>Entire Agreement\r\n</b></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">If any part of these Terms of Use is determined to be invalid or unenforceable pursuant to applicable law including, but not limited to, the warranty disclaimers and liability limitations set forth above, then the invalid or unenforceable provision will be deemed to be superseded by a valid, enforceable provision that most closely matches the intent of the original provision and the remainder of the Terms of Use shall continue to be in effect.\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Unless otherwise specified herein, these Terms of Use constitutes the entire agreement between You and Analogue Mall.com concerning the Site/Services and it supersedes all prior or contemporaneous communications and proposals, whether electronic, oral or written.\r\n</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>\r\n</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>\r\n</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>\r\n</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>\r\n</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b> \r\n</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>\r\n</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>\r\n</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>\r\n</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>\r\n</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>\r\n</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>\r\n</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>\r\n</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>\r\n</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>\r\n</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center