\n</div><div>\r\n</div><div>\r\n</div><div>\r\n</div><div>\r\n</div><div>\r\n</div><div>\r\n</div>','en','2021-08-09 11:05:15','2021-08-09 19:30:30'),(2,6,'Privacy Policy Page','<p style=\"text-align: center; \"></p><h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>Privacy Policy</b></h4><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Analogue Incorporate (“Analogue Mall”, “We” or “our”) is the author and publisher of the internet resource www.AnalogueMall.com (AnalogueMall.com). We are responsible forlisting and permitting transactions concerning products and electronic items of various brands (“Product(s)”). Analogue Mall owns and operates the services provided through its website. Analogue Mall owns the internet resource www.AnalogueMall.com(“Website”) on the World Wide Web. Also, all variant services, and on/in which this privacy policy is posted or referenced, (including all files and images contained in or generated by and accompanied data, together with the “Services”) is owned by Analogue Mall Private Limited. All customers, visitors, products and services of Analogue Mall are together termed as “You” or “Users”. We created this privacy policy (“Privacy Policy”) to give protection of User’s privacy and build confidence for the Users to use Our services. When You use Our Services You are governed by this Privacy Policy and Terms of Use. Any capitalized term used but not defined in this Privacy Policy shall have the meaning in Our Terms of Use.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">BY USING THE SERVICES, YOU AGREE TO THE POLICIES OUTLINED IN THIS PRIVACY POLICY AND YOU HEREBY CONSENT TO OUR COLLECTION, USE AND SHARING OF YOUR INFORMATION AS DESCRIBED IN THIS PRIVACY POLICY. IF YOU DO NOT AGREE WITH THIS PRIVACY POLICY, YOU CANNOT USE THE SERVICES. IF YOU USE THE SERVICES ON BEHALF OF SOMEONE ELSE (SUCH AS YOUR CHILD) OR AN ENTITY (SUCH AS YOUR EMPLOYER), YOU REPRESENT THAT YOU ARE AUTHORISED BY SUCH INDIVIDUAL OR ENTITY TO ACCEPT THIS PRIVACY POLICY ON SUCH INDIVIDUAL’S OR ENTITY’S BEHALF.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>Access to Personal  Data and Identification</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">To provide You with the services, we collect personally identifiable data like gender, marital status, age, preferences, likes and dislikes etc.; financial information like banking details and any other information relating to Your income or lifestyle; contact and shipping information like physical address, shipping address, postal address and contact numbers etc.; when You set up a free account with AnalogueMall.com. While You can browse some sections of Our site without being a registered member, certain activities (such as placing an order) do require registration.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">We reserve the right to contact You on the information provided, both email and mobile phone numbers, with the intent of keeping You updated with Your order status or any other data that may impact Your shopping experience with Analogue Mall Pvt. Ltd. This may require Us to contact You on Your number even if it is listed on the Do Not Disturb (DND) list. If You prefer to be contacted on another number, then You must explicitly state the same in Your order or call Our customer service section. Also, we may use Your contact information to send You offers based on Your previous orders and Your interests unless explicitly opted out by You.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>Access to Demographic and Profile Data</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;Services will be provided only with the help of Your data as mentioned in point number 1. We take Your personal information to resolve disputes; troubleshoot issues; help promote a safe service; collect fees owed; measure consumer interest in our products and services, timely inform You about online and offline offers, products, services, and updates; customize Your experience; and as otherwise described to You at the time of collection.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Our efforts to continually improve Our product and services, we need to collect and analyze demographic and profile data about Our Users\' activity on Our website.<br>We identify and use Your IP address to help diagnose problems with Our server and to administer Our Website. Your IP address is also used to help identify You and to gather broad demographic information.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>Correspondence Information</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">For security reasons data about Your correspondents, and the destination/origin of communications between You and any other person using Our services, along with email communications, blog, chat room, instant message communications, expert’s forum communications, and membership of mailing lists etc.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>Cookies</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">A \"cookie\" is a small piece of information accessed by a web browser so it can be later read back from that browser. Cookies are useful for enabling the browser to remember information specific to a given User. Analogue Mall.com places both permanent and temporary cookies in Your computer\'s hard drive.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>Transactional Information</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">We also take insights into the information about Your transactional history (other than banking details) of Your e-commerce activities.<br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>Sharing of personal information</b><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">We may share Your personal information with Our other corporate entities and affiliates to, help detect and prevent identity theft, fraud and other potentially illegal acts correlate or directly related to Your multiple accounts to prevent abuse of Our services. Also, to facilitate joint or co-branded services that You have or had requested where such services are provided by more than one corporate entity.<br>We may disclose private information if required to do so by law or in the good faith belief that such disclosure is reasonably necessary to respond to subpoenas, court orders, or other legal processes. We may disclose personal information to law enforcement offices, third party rights owners, or others in the good faith belief that such disclosure is reasonably necessary to enforce Our Terms or Privacy Policy. Also to help respond to claims that an advertisement, posting or other content violates the rights of a third party; or protect the rights, property or personal safety of Our Users or the general public.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Analogue Mall.com will share some of Your personal information with another business entity if we (or Our assets) plan to merge with or be acquired by that business entity. After such a partnership, the other business entity (or the new combined entity) will be required to follow this privacy policy concerning Your personal information.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>Security Precautions</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Our site has careful security measures to protect the loss, misuse, and alteration of Your information. Whenever You change or access Your account information, we offer the use of a secure server. Once Your information is in Our control, We ensure to strict security guidelines, protecting it against unauthorized access.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>Choice/Opt-Out</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>AnalogueMall.com</b> provides all Users with the option to go out of receiving non-essential (promotional, marketing-related) communications from Us on behalf of Our partners, and from Us in general, after setting up an account. You can just unsubscribe to the offers and they won’t show up again.<br>If You have any questions, with regards to the privacy policy, You can contact Us via email at info@analoguemall.com</p><p></p><p></p><div><b>\r\n</b></div><div><b>\r\n</b></div><div><b>\r\n</b></div><div><b>\r\n</b></div><div><b>\r\n</b></div><div><b>\r\n</b></div><div><b>\r\n</b></div><div><b>\r\n</b></div><div><b>\r\n</b></div><div><b>\r\n</b></div><div><b>\r\n</b></div><div><b>\r\n</b></div><div><b>\r\n</b></div><div><b>\r\n</b></div><div><b> \r\n</b></div><div><b>\r\n</b></div><div><b> \r\n</b></div><div><b>\r\n</b></div><div><b> \r\n</b></div><div><b>\r\n</b></div><div><b>\r\n</b></div><div><b>\r\n</b></div><p></p>','en','2021-08-09 11:47:19','2021-08-09 21:34:27'),(3,7,'Preowned Terms of Use','<p><b>Preowned Terms of Use</b></p><p>Welcome to analoguemall.com/preowned. By using Analogue Mall through website or from any electronic devices (like but not limited to mobile phone application), you acknowledge, understand and agree to following Terms of Use (\"Terms\").\r\n</p><p>Analogue Mall may change or modify the Terms in the future and for any or no reason by posting revisions here. Your continued use of the Site constitutes your acceptance of the revised Terms. You should visit this page and review the Terms from time to time.\r\n</p><p><b>Acceptance Through Use\r\n</b></p><p>By posting or viewing a classified advertisement on the Site (an “Ad” or “Ads”), you agree to be bound by all of the terms, conditions and notices contained or referenced in these Terms. If you do not accept all of the Terms, you are not authorized to post or view any Ads and shall discontinue using this Site immediately.\r\n</p><p><b>Eligibility / Minimum Age\r\n</b></p><p>Analogue Mall is not directed to, and is not authorized to post or view Ads, by anyone under the age of eighteen (18) and\r\n</p><p>If you are using Analogue Mall on behalf of a legal entity, you shall be responsible to obtain necessary authority to post or retrieve any information on the Site and you agree to be accountable for that information.\r\n</p><p><b>Understanding of Assured and Non-assured transactions:\r\n</b></p><p>You agree and understand that Analogue Mall is an internet classified platform that facilitates communication between users for the purpose of advertising and sharing information related to goods and/ or services.\r\n</p><p><i style=\"\"><u>Assured terms of use:\r\n</u></i></p><ul><li>Six months warranty on the products bought from our channel\r\n</li><li>Guarantee of genuine products \r\n</li><li>Buyers will buy the goods directly from the Analogue Mall\r\n</li></ul><p><i><u>Non-assured terms of use:\r\n</u></i></p><ul><li>Analogue Mall doesn’t stand liable for any products through this medium\r\n</li><li>Transactions take place totally between buyers/sellers and Analogue Mall stands no right to interfere \r\n</li><li>If the buyer faces any sort of unlawful activity by the seller, he/she is solely responsible\r\n</li><li>Analogue Mall do not endorse or promote any of the listings, or information posted by users. These users (including You) are third parties and are not related to Analogue Mallr or its affiliates. You agree not to hold Analogue Mall responsible for information posted by these users or for their act in any circumstances.\r\n</li><li>You further understand that Analogue Mall is not involved in transaction of any goods / services listed in the Site. You will be directly contacting users who have posted advertisement regarding their goods or services offering.\r\n</li><li>If you are using information from Site, in order to communicate / sale / purchase any goods or services from other users, we strongly encourage you take necessary precaution to protect yourself. We recommend that you read our Safety Tips before doing any transaction with other users.\r\n</li></ul><p><b>User Submitted Content\r\n</b></p><p>By posting or submitting any content to the Site, including any audio or visual files, classified advertisement or personal information (collectively, \"Your Content\"), during the registration, posting, through interactive public forums or any other feature of the Site you affirm, represent and warrant that\r\n</p><p>(1) you lawfully own or have rights including the copyright, to Your Content\r\n</p><p>(2) none of the materials included in Your Content are unlawful, defamatory, libelous, obscene or pornographic, promotes racism or hatred based on age, gender, race, religion, caste, class\r\n</p><p>(3) use of Your Content will not violate any legal rights (privacy, intellectual property, etc) of any third party\r\n</p><p>(4) you are solely responsible and accountable for Your Content\r\n</p><p>Moreover, you agree not post or list any information:\r\n</p><p>(1) that is related to the sale of any illegal, counterfeit, stolen goods and / or services\r\n</p><p>(2) of goods / services of which you are not lawful owner or do not have authority to list for\r\n</p><p>(3) containing virus, spam, pyramid schemes or any similar forms\r\n</p><p>(4) related to goods / or services that is prohibited by laws &amp; regulation of Federal Democratic Republic of Nepal\r\n</p><p>(5) not allowed by Site\'s Ad Posting Rules\r\n</p><p>You hereby grant Analogue Mall a worldwide, royalty-free, perpetual, irrevocable, non- exclusive, transferable, sub-licensable right and license (the “License”) to use, license, distribute, copy, reproduce, transmit, translate, publicly display, publicly perform, publish and prepare derivative works of Your Content in connection with the Site as well as on any of affiliates or partners websites, publications and mobile platform in any formats and through any media channels. We need these rights with respect to Your Content in order to host and display content.\r\n</p><p><b>Violations by User\r\n</b></p><p>Analogue Mall moderators may monitor Your Content as it appears on the Site and may delete Your Content at any time and for any or no reason without your permission.\r\n</p><p>You agree that in the event your listing, posting or your information violates any provision of these Terms or the Ad Posting Rules, we shall have the right to terminate and or suspend your membership of the Site and refuse to provide you or any person acting on your behalf, access to the Site.\r\n</p><p><b>Community based Reporting\r\n</b></p><p>You agree to inform Analogue Mall moderators if you come across any listing or posting that is unlawful, offensive or violates our Terms, Ad Posting rules or infringes any intellectual property rights by clicking on \'Report Ad\' link to enable us to keep the site working efficiently and in a safe manner.\r\n</p><p>We reserve the right to take down any of such posting, listing or information and or limit or terminate our services and further take all reasonable technical and legal steps to prevent the misuse of the Site.\r\n</p><p><b>Intellectual Property / Copyrights\r\n</b></p><p>The Site contains content which includes\r\n</p><p>a) Your Content,\r\n</p><p>b) Analogue’s information,\r\n</p><p>c) and information from other users.\r\n</p><p>You acknowledge that all content and materials available at the Site (other than Your Content) are owned by respective owner. You agree not to copy, modify, sell, rent or distribute content that is not owned by you. Such content is protected by Government of Nepal Copyright Laws.\r\n</p><p><b>Site Usage / Your Responsibility\r\n</b></p><p>Analogue Mall grants you a partial, non-transferable and revocable license to access and make personal use of this site. You may download, print or view individual pages of the Site for non-commercial use, provided you do not delete, change or otherwise modify any of the Content, including any copyright or trademark notices.\r\n</p><p>You may not use the site for any commercial purpose, including but not limited to, sending unsolicited commercial email or making unsolicited commercial phone calls to users.\r\n</p><p>Much of the information related to goods and /or services is provided by the respective users and may include errors or inaccuracies. This information provided is intended as only general guidelines and you shall make effort to verify this information. Analogue Mall do not guarantee the accuracy and disclaim liability for such inaccuracies related to product and service information.\r\n</p><p>You are solely responsible for protecting and securing your password of Analogue Mall account and for restricting unauthorized access to your computer or electronic device. You are responsible for all activities that occur under your Analogue mall’s account. In case you learn about unauthorized use of your account, you shall notify Analogue Mall to block account immediately.\r\n</p><p>As a condition of your use of this Web site, you warrant that you will not use this Web site for any purpose that is unlawful or prohibited by Government of Nepal.\r\n</p><p><b>Limitation of Liability\r\n</b></p><p>The users providing product and services through advertisements are independent contractors and are NOT officers, employees, agents of Analogue Mall. Therefore, Analogue is not liable for the errors, representation, breaches, acts, or carelessness of any such users for any personal injuries, damages, death or expenses resulting therefrom.\r\n</p><p>You agree not to hold Analogue Mall responsible or accountable for third party content, listing, or information and nor liable for any misuse, illegal activity as most postings or information are submitted by various users directly and Analogue Mall do not have any role in its creation.\r\n</p><p>You further agree that Analogue Mall is not liable for any loss of money, goodwill, or reputation, or any special, indirect, or consequential damages arising out of your use of the site content or as a result of any sale, purchase of goods and services with other users of the site.\r\n</p><p>By visiting and using Analogue Mall you agree that the laws of Government of Nepal, without regard to principles of conflict of laws, will govern these Terms of Use and any dispute of any sort that might arise between you and Hamrobazar.com or its affiliates.\r\n</p><p><b>Indemnification\r\n</b></p><p>The User should agree to indemnify and hold Analogue Mall, its officers, subsidiaries, affiliates, successors, assigns, directors, agents, service providers, and employees, harmless from any claim or demand, including reasonable attorney fees and court costs, made by any third party due to or arising out of content submitted by the user, users use of the service, violation of the terms of use, breach by the user of any of the representations and warranties herein, or user\'s violation of any rights of another.\r\n</p><p><b>Third Party Content and Services\r\n</b></p><p>Our Site may contain hyperlinks to Web sites operated by parties other than Analogue Mall or its affiliates. Such hyperlinks are provided for your reference and we do not control such Web sites and we are not responsible for their contents or your use of them.\r\n</p><p>It is the users responsibility to take all protective measures to guard against viruses or other destructive elements they may encounter on these third party sites. Analoguemakes no warranty or representation regarding, and do not endorse any linked website or the information appearing thereon or any of the products or services described thereon.\r\n</p><p><b>Delivery / Payments / Billing\r\n</b></p><p>Analogue Mall does not deliver nor does accept payment from users for any product or services listed. Analogue Mall is not involved in buying or selling activities nor does it act as agent or middleman of buyer/seller.\r\n</p><p>All product/services are listed by Users (Sellers), who have posted information of their offerings. Sellers are themselves responsible to deliver, obtain payment and issue bill for their sales. Similarly Users making purchases (Buyers) are self-responsible to verify goods / services before releasing any payments.\r\n</p><p>Users (Buyer or Seller) should take necessary measures and obtain appropriate documents related to dealings as they would in traditional offline transactions. Any contractual obligation regarding payment, delivery, terms, conditions, warranties or representations associated are solely between Users (Buyer &amp; Seller), and Analogue Mall is not part of such contract in any manner.\r\n</p><p><b>Privacy Policy\r\n</b></p><p>Protecting privacy is important to us but due to the nature of our business, some functions and services offered through our site requires user to provide certain personal information such as name, email address, contact address, phone numbers, etc for communication purpose and such information collected are provided to us voluntarily. Some of this information is displayed publicly in Internet and may be used by third parties, on whom we do not have any control. Similarly some of personal information is shared with other users in order to facilitate communication.\r\n</p><p>Some of computer data are involuntarily collected by our system in order to ensure proper functioning of our services. These data includes cookies, user IP address, site browsing behavior, page traffic &amp; information related to computer, browser, screen, etc. Third party vendor, including Google may also collect these data in order to display ads based user behavior.\r\n</p><p>We use collected information and data to provide our services, facilitate communication between users, customize information, communicate marketing and promotional offers (which you can opt out anytime), display third parties advertisements, identify user, market research, troubleshoot &amp; improve or develop our system.\r\n</p><p>We do not sell or rent users personal information to third parties without users explicit consent. However we may be required from time to time to disclose users personal information to Governmental or law enforcement authorities. We may also disclose personal information to enforce our policies regarding to claims made by others for violation of their rights, privacy and property. We may share some part of your personal information with our service provider (including but not limited to mobile network operators, hosting providers, etc), who helps us in functioning of our business and technical operations.\r\n</p><p>We store this personal information on secure computer &amp; ensure best effort to protect from unauthorized access and malicious use. However transmission of data over internet is not under our control and may not be completely safe.\r\n</p><p>You can modify, delete your personal details, posting &amp; other information from our system whenever you want. But we might retain backup / archive of such information for purposes not limited to reporting, regulatory compliances, etc for reasonable time. We may aggregate information in manner to anonymize data, and supply such non-personally identifiable data to our affiliates</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2021-08-09 17:55:19','2021-08-23 18:57:13'),(4,8,'Preowned Listing Policy','<p><b>Listing Policy\r\n</b></p><p>For use of our Site and other services, you confirm and declare that you shall not list or post or provide information in relation to the sale or purchase or exchange of goods and services, content or information that are illegal under the laws of the nation and/or are not permitted as per the prohibited items policy listed below.\r\n</p><p>Analogue mall does not allow posting of ads that are considered illegal as per Nepalese law and/or are not permitted as per below Ad posting rules. Any user found violating these rules will be subjected to action/s mentioned below.\r\n</p><p>1. <b>Multiple (duplicate/repeat) ad posting.\r\n</b></p><p>Users are not allowed to post more than 1 (one) similar active ad. Similar active ad are defined as ads selling or looking for same product or service, even if these ad contain different text or images and/or is posted from same or different account by a user.\r\n</p><p>Each user is only allowed to post an ad similar to his/her previous ad if the previous one has been marked as sold, has been deleted or has already expired.\r\n</p><p>2. <b>Misleading and fraudulent ads.\r\n</b></p><p>Some of the ads (but not limited) which fall under this are:\r\n</p><ul><li>Ads title, price and content must be related. For e.g. posting ad with title Iphone 10 with irrelevant price Rs. 5000 is not allowed.\r\n</li><li>Ads title should not include Price or Phone numbers, there is separate field for that.\r\n</li><li>Ads posted with marketing gimmick words with sole purpose of grabbing other user attention. For e.g. posting ad \"Best opportunity of your life\", \"Click this to earn money\", \"Call me soon\", \"Don\'t miss out\" etc.\r\n</li><li>Ads with Inaccurate/wrong prices. You need to clearly mention the price in your ad. For e.g. posting ad with price Rs. 5,000 but when later contacted you are asking another price.\r\n</li><li>Ads with Incorrect/wrong item condition mentioned. For e.g. posting used goods as Brand New, not disclosing defectiveness of goods.\r\n</li><li>Ads selling stolen and illegal goods.\r\n</li><li>Ads selling fake, replica and counterfeited goods by representing them as original.\r\n</li><li>Ads with sole purpose of leading user to another website or generate downloads without actual sale of product or service.\r\n</li><li>Ads which have Images unrelated with the ad content. Posting graphic (violent or adult oriented) images are not allowed.</li></ul><p>\r\n</p><p>3. <b>Mis-categorized (wrong category) ads.\r\n</b></p><p>Ads must be posted in the correct category. For e.g. posting a mobile ad in computer category, or headphones in mobiles category is considered as mis-categorized ad. If you are unsure which category your ads belongs to, kindly search for existing ads to know where other users have posted similar ad. If your ad falls under more than one category, select the best and post your ad only in that category.\r\n</p><p>4. <b>Posting illegal or morally obscene ads.\r\n</b></p><ul><li>Analogue Mall does not allow ads which are illegal as per Nepal law or are considered morally obscene in context to Nepalese society. Some of the ads (but not limited to) which fall under are:\r\n</li><li>Ads for Prostitution, obscene items or any form of adult entertainment ads like escort, indecent massages, pornography, sexual items, etc.\r\n</li><li>Ads which hurt the sentiments of any person, group or religion.\r\n</li><li>Ads selling illegal items like weapons, drugs, human organs, endangered animals, prohibited antiques, black marketing, etc.\r\n</li><li>Ads which infringes other third parties intellectual property, moral right and privacy.\r\n</li></ul><p><b>Consequences on Violation of Ad Posting Rules.\r\n</b></p><p>Users who violate ad posting rules and site\'s terms of use may be subjected to any of the following actions, as per seriousness of violation deemed by us:\r\n</p><p>1. Warning from site admin about the violation.\r\n</p><p>2. Deletion of ads with/without prior notice.\r\n</p><p>3. You maybe asked to provide identification documents.\r\n</p><p>4. Temporary or Permanent blocking of account/access to the site.\r\n</p><p>5. Reporting to Law Enforcement agency or Appropriate Authorities.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p> \r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>','en','2021-08-09 17:57:15','2021-08-23 18:56:04'),(5,9,'Preowned Return Policy','<p>Preowned Return Policy</p>','en','2021-08-09 17:57:50','2021-08-09 17:57:50'),(6,10,'Tradein Terms and Conditions','<p><b>Last Updated:11th Dec 2020</b></p><p><b>\r\n</b></p><div>Please read these Terms and Conditions carefully before using the Analogue Trade In websitess operated by our Company, Analogue Incorporate . We provide Electronics Trading services which Trades products in cash or in goods (Electronic), a company incorporated in Kathmandu Nepal with company number612853944 whose registered office is at Pingalasthan Gaushala, Kathmandu Nepal. You can contact us by Telephone on_9802320803, by email to info@analoguemall.com. Our role is to provide easy access to obtaining electronics for our clients.</div><div><br></div><div>We reserve the right to all times to vary, change, alter, amend, add to or remove any of these Terms. Please ensure that you review these Terms each time you use the Website as you will be deemed to have accepted a variation if you continue to use the Website after the Variation has been posted.<br></div><div>\r\n</div><div>The current draft of these Terms was adopted and published on 11th Dec 2020.</div><div><br></div><div>\r\n</div><div><b>1. Information about you and Visits to the Website</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>\r\n</b></div><div>These Website Standard Terms and Conditions contained herein on this webpage, shall govern your use of this website, including all pages within this website (collectively referred to herein below as this Analogue TradeIN. Your access to and use of the Service is conditioned on your acceptance of and compliance with these Terms. These Terms apply to all visitors, users and others who access osr use the Service. These Terms apply in full force and effect to your use of this Website and by using this Website; you expressly accept all terms and conditions contained herein in full. You must not use this Website, if you have any objection to any of these Website Standard Terms and Conditions. By accessing or using the Service you agree to be bound by these Terms.\r\n</div><div><br></div><div>If you disagree with any part of the terms then you may not access the service. If you no longer wish to have a registered account, we may terminate your account by sending an email to your id . If you no longer accept these terms and conditions, or any future modification to these terms and conditions, you must cease using the Website. If you continue using the site it indicates your continued acceptance of these terms and conditions.</div><div><br></div><div>\r\n</div><div>If, for any reason, we believe that you have not complied with these terms and conditions, we may, at our sole discretion, cancel your access to the registration areas of the site immediately and without prior notice or we may terminate your registered account, at our sole discretion, by emailing you at the address you have registered stating that the agreement has terminated.</div><div><b><br></b></div><div>\r\n</div><div><b>2. Intellectual Property Rights</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>\r\n</b></div><div>Analogue Trade In holds the sole ownership of Analogue TradeIn. All the rights to operate the website will remain to Analogue TradeIn , while third parties involved in functioning of the website will be under contractual bases or the Terms and Conditions involved in this website. Third party has no rights to intervene in the operation of the website unless and until mentioned in their contact itself.\r\n</div><div>Analogue TradeIn owns all rights to obtain and use the details of Users/ Clients registered in the Website which includes contact information, history of trade done with _ Analogue TradeIn, authentic identification card or required information, and other details required for the website are retain as per their essential requirement. Whereas the identity certificate (citizenship) or government based identity card of the Client will remain private and protected.\r\n</div><div><br></div><div>The sole authority of changing or modifying the content and incorporating new products and information in the Website is with Analogue TradeIn (Licensor). If there is any breach in the contract between licensor and the third party during the operation of the website, the licensor at any time has the right to discredit that particular third party from their Website according to Contract Act 2000-chapter 12 section 82 of Nepal.\r\n</div><div><br></div><div>No other company has the right to establish their website in the name of Analogue TradeIn. has the Copyright to the Website named Analogue TradeIn according to Copyright Act 2002-chapter 2 section 3 of Nepal.AnalogueTradeIn owns all rights to the intellectual property and material contained in this website, and all such rights are reserved.\r\n</div><div>The Website contains trademarks which belong to AnalogueTradeIn or which have been licensed to Analogue TradeIn by the trademark owners according to Chapter 4 section 16 of Nepal’s The Patent, Design and Trade Mark Act, 1965. Any use of these trademarks by you is forbidden unless prior written permission has been obtained from the trademark owner. Analogue TradeIn will take legal action against any individual or organization which seeks to use_Analogue TradeIn name, materials, logos or trademarks for unlawful purpose. You may not remove any copyright, trademark or intellectual property notices contained in the original material from any material downloaded or copied from the Website.</div><div><br></div><div>Links to the Website are not permitted, other than links to the homepage for your personal use, except with our prior written permission. Links to the Website from within a frameset definition are not permitted except with our prior written permission.\r\n</div><div>You may not create a database by systematically downloading substantial parts of the Website. You are granted a limited license only, subject to the restrictions provided in these Terms, for purposes of viewing the material contained on this Website.</div><div><br></div><div>\r\n</div><div><b>3. Access to and use of our Website</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>\r\n</b></div><div>You may only use the Website for lawful purposes. When using the Website, you must not:</div><div>\r\n</div><p></p><ul><li>Publishing any Website material in any media